window.ARC_NEWS = [
 {
  "id": "one-year-anniversary",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/one-year-anniversary",
  "date": "2026-10-30",
  "tags": [],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/a700c5fa-c3c8-first-anniversary-character-card-600x200-600x200.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "One year anniversary of ARC Raiders: Thanks for being here!",
   "zh": "ARC Raiders 一周年纪念：感谢有你！"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Hey Raiders,</p>",
    "zh": "<p>嘿，奇袭者们，</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Can you believe it? Today marks one year of ARC Raiders!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>你们敢相信吗？今天就是 ARC Raiders 一周年！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>You’ve done more Topside in one year than we ever  expected - thank you for joining us in the Rust Belt and making it your own. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>你们在一年里在上层的表现远超我们的预期——感谢你们来到锈带，并把这里变成自己的家园。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Here are some of the wildest numbers from your first year of raiding:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>以下是你们第一年奇袭行动中最疯狂的一些数字：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/ArcRaiders_FirstAnniversary_Infographic_16x9-Approved-1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/ArcRaiders_FirstAnniversary_Infographic_16x9-Approved.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Frozen Trail</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>霜痕小径</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>We’ve been having a blast watching you explore the Frozen Trail update and challenge yourself with the new content we’ve been working on. We’re already hard at work on what comes next, but why not take a second to see what people think about the new update and our first lap around the sun?</p>",
    "zh": "<p>我们一直很开心地看着你们探索霜痕小径更新，并挑战我们一直在制作的新内容。我们已经在努力开发接下来的内容，但为什么不花点时间看看大家对这次新更新以及我们第一年的看法呢？</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "video",
    "id": "5VY9AjKEb0Y",
    "title": "1st Anniversary Accolades | ARC Raiders"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Get your gift!</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>领取你的礼物！</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>We want to offer a small token of our appreciation for playing ARC Raiders and helping us build the future of this game. Log in to the game and access your free gift - it’ll be waiting in your inbox!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>我们想送上一份小小的谢意，感谢你们游玩 ARC Raiders 并帮助我们共同打造这款游戏的未来。登录游戏并领取你的免费礼物——它会在你的收件箱里等着你！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Raiders, here’s to another year. We’ve got lots planned for the future and we hope you stick around for the ride. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>奇袭者们，为下一年干杯。我们为未来准备了很多计划，希望你们能继续与我们同行。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>See you Topside,</p>",
    "zh": "<p>上层见，</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The ARC Raiders Team</p>",
    "zh": "<p>ARC Raiders 团队</p>"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "corsair-collab-exclusive-rewards",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/corsair-collab-exclusive-rewards",
  "date": "2026-10-29",
  "tags": [],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/b92ec260-9042-corsair-collab-card-600x200-600x200.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "ARC Raiders x CORSAIR: Official gear collection and exclusive in-game rewards",
   "zh": "ARC Raiders × CORSAIR：官方外设系列与独家游戏内奖励"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/8621443c-9600-ArcRaiders_ScreenShot_16x9_Corsair-1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/8621443c-9600-ArcRaiders_ScreenShot_16x9_Corsair.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Never fumble the extraction</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>绝不让撤离失手</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Has this ever happened to you? Bag full of loot. Elevator opening. You’re almost home and dry. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>你是否遇到过这种情况？背包里装满了搜刮来的物资。电梯门打开。你几乎就要安全脱身了。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Then something with too many legs comes over the ridge. You go for the dodge roll, your thumb leaves the stick, and suddenly… it’s all over. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>然后某个腿多得离谱的东西翻过山脊。你想翻滚闪避，拇指离开摇杆，突然之间……一切都完了。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Next thing you know you’re waking up in Speranza, one kit lighter with the promise of what could have been. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>接下来你就在斯佩兰扎醒来，少了一套装备，只剩下对“本该如此”的遗憾。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>First rule of raiding: <em>Never let your fingers leave the controls. </em></p>",
    "zh": "<p>奇袭第一法则：<em>手指永远不要离开操控装置。</em></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>ARC Raiders has teamed up with CORSAIR, SCUF Gaming, and Elgato on an official collection of gear built for Topside. Every piece dons Raider styling, and every purchase unlocks exclusive in-game rewards.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>ARC Raiders 与 CORSAIR、SCUF Gaming 和 Elgato 合作，推出专为上层打造的官方装备系列。每件装备都采用奇袭者风格设计，每次购买都能解锁专属游戏内奖励。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/49bc71e6-4f03-ArcRaiders_ScreenShot_16x9_Corsair_03-20-1--1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/49bc71e6-4f03-ArcRaiders_ScreenShot_16x9_Corsair_03%20(1).jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>What’s In the Collection</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>系列包含哪些内容</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Controllers for PlayStation, Xbox, and PC. A keyboard, mouse, headset, two mouse pads, and a Stream Deck. All of it in ARC Raiders-inspired design. Here are the details:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>适用于 PlayStation、Xbox 和 PC 的手柄。键盘、鼠标、耳机、两块鼠标垫和一个 Stream Deck。全部采用 ARC Raiders 灵感设计。详情如下：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li><strong>SCUF Gaming</strong> – Omega (PS5 and PC), Valor Pro Wireless  (Xbox and PC), Valor Pro Faceplate Kit, and Nemesis Pro 8K (coming soon, PC). Customizable gaming controllers with rear paddles so your thumbs never leave the sticks, and triggers that fire the instant you do.</li><li><strong>CORSAIR</strong> – CLIPPER PRO MINI 60 keyboard, SABRE v2 PRO Wireless MG mouse, HS80 RGB WIRELESS headset, and MM cloth mouse pads in Large and 2XL. The 2XL is a map. What it leads to... Well, that’s why you need the rest of the gear.</li><li><strong>Elgato</strong> – Stream Deck MK.2 and a matching faceplate, for Raiders who stream, multitask, and control their entire setups during the raid.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li><strong>SCUF Gaming</strong> – Omega（PS5 和 PC）、Valor Pro Wireless（Xbox 和 PC）、Valor Pro 面板套件，以及 Nemesis Pro 8K（即将推出，PC）。可定制游戏手柄，带背部拨片，让你的拇指永不离开摇杆，扳机在你扣下的瞬间即触发。</li><li><strong>CORSAIR</strong> – CLIPPER PRO MINI 60 键盘、SABRE v2 PRO Wireless MG 鼠标、HS80 RGB WIRELESS 耳机，以及大号和 2XL 两种尺寸的 MM 布面鼠标垫。2XL 款是一张地图。它指向何处……嗯，这正是你需要其余装备的原因。</li><li><strong>Elgato</strong> – Stream Deck MK.2 和配套面板，适合直播、多任务处理并在奇袭期间掌控整个设备的奇袭者。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Quantities are limited. Scrappy is not included, but he approves.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>数量有限。废品仔不包含在内，但他表示认可。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/c1ca9b89-7579-ArcRaiders_ScreenShot_16x9_Corsair_04-20-2--1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/c1ca9b89-7579-ArcRaiders_ScreenShot_16x9_Corsair_04%20(2).jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>How to Get Your in-Game Rewards</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>如何获取游戏内奖励</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Starting October 29, every qualifying product purchased from the official collection at corsair.com comes with a unique single-use code to unlock exclusive in-game items. Codes can be redeemed on PlayStation, Xbox, or PC the Embark ID Portal here: <a href=\"https://id.embark.games/id/arc-raiders/giveaway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://id.embark.games/id/arc-raiders/giveaway</a>. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>从 10 月 29 日起，凡在 corsair.com 官方系列购买合格产品，都将获得一个独特的一次性代码，用于解锁专属游戏内物品。代码可在 PlayStation、Xbox 或 PC 上通过 Embark ID 门户兑换：<a href=\"https://id.embark.games/id/arc-raiders/giveaway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://id.embark.games/id/arc-raiders/giveaway</a>。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Preorders open October 29 coinciding with ARC Raiders&#x27; first anniversary, while exact shipping dates will vary. Frozen Trail is live, the Rust Belt has a new frontier, and now you&#x27;ve got the gear for it.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>预购于 10 月 29 日开启，恰逢 ARC Raiders 一周年，具体发货日期会有所不同。霜痕小径已上线，锈带有了新前线，而现在你也有了相应的装备。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>To see full details, product availability, and redeem codes, visit <a href=\"https://corsair.com/arc-raiders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">corsair.com/arc-raiders</a>.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>查看完整详情、产品供应情况和兑换代码，请访问 <a href=\"https://corsair.com/arc-raiders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">corsair.com/arc-raiders</a>。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><br></p>",
    "zh": "<p><br></p>"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "who-are-the-contradas-of-toledo",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/who-are-the-contradas-of-toledo",
  "date": "2026-10-29",
  "tags": [],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/c13e1ec7-92bf-contradas-card-600x200-600x200.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "The ‘Contradas’ of Toledo: Who are they?",
   "zh": "托雷多的“Contradas”：他们是谁？"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>How long has it been since the storm that first swept you into Speranza? </strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>自从那场风暴第一次把你卷入斯佩兰扎，已经过去了多久？ </strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>It’s given you a home, a place to grow, and the tools to become the Raider you were meant to be. With everything Speranza has offered, it’s easy to believe that this is the only kernel of civilization left. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>它给了你一个家，一个成长的地方，以及成为你注定要成为的奇袭者所需的工具。斯佩兰扎给予的一切，让人很容易相信这是仅存的文明火种。 </p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>But you’re not just a citizen of Speranza, you’re a citizen of Toledo; a larger collection of neighborhoods that form the only reliable refuge in the Rust Belt. The alliance between Speranza and the other ‘Contradas’ is shaky and transactional, but necessary.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>但你不只是斯佩兰扎的公民，你还是托雷多的公民；这是一个由多个街区组成的更大集合，构成了锈带中唯一可靠的避难所。斯佩兰扎与其他“城区”之间的联盟脆弱且充满交易色彩，但却是必要的。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/2805571e-402c-ArcRaiders_ScreenShot_16x9_Contradasl-1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/2805571e-402c-ArcRaiders_ScreenShot_16x9_Contradasl.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The season of Soul’s Offering is upon Toledo, a time when citizens pause to honor the Raiders that came before by building shrines for the fallen. Celeste wants to forge more resilient bonds with the neighboring Contradas at this time of unity, by collecting items to build offerings for each of the neighborhoods: Ferrovia, Murteta, and Vaulto. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>奉灵节已降临托雷多，这是一个公民们停下脚步、通过为逝者建造神龛来纪念先辈奇袭者的时节。塞莱斯特希望在这个团结的时刻，与邻近城区建立更坚韧的纽带，收集物品为每个街区制作祭品：费罗维亚街区、穆尔泰塔和沃尔托。 </p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Every Contrada brings something crucial to the security and prosperity of Toledo. But with each neighborhood driven by fiercely conflicting values, managing these relationships is more important than ever.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>每个城区都为托雷多的安全与繁荣贡献着至关重要的力量。但由于各街区秉持着激烈冲突的价值观，处理这些关系比以往任何时候都更加重要。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>So who are the various Contradas, and what do they mean for the society of Toledo as a whole?</p>",
    "zh": "<p>那么，各个城区都是谁，它们对托雷多整体社会意味着什么？</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Speranza</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>斯佩兰扎</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The oldest neighborhood of Toledo, your home. Established as an independent settlement after the Second Wave of ARC forced humanity underground, its citizens doggedly pursue a spirit of resilience, ambition, and hope.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>托雷多最古老的街区，你的家。在第二波ARC浪潮迫使人类转入地下后，它作为独立定居点建立起来，其公民顽强地追求着坚韧、雄心和希望的精神。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Neapolitan buildings and infrastructure, swallowed by sinkholes and preserved below the ground. Vaulted glass skylights illuminate the bustling plazas and marketplaces which you’ve seen are as busy as ever.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>那不勒斯风格的建筑和基础设施，被天坑吞没并保存在地下。拱形玻璃天窗照亮了熙攘的广场和市场，你所见之处一如既往地繁忙。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Speranza is a melting pot, culturally porous and welcoming of strangers. Its open way-of-life cultivates a diversity of Raiders, from fearless warriors to peaceful collectors, but their community-focus and uncodified power structure are frowned upon by some. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>斯佩兰扎是一个大熔炉，文化上开放包容，欢迎陌生人。其开放的生活方式培育了多样化的奇袭者，从无畏的战士到平和的收藏家，但他们以社区为中心、不成文的权力结构却遭到一些人的非议。 </p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Murteta</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>穆尔泰塔</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Frustrated by Speranza’s laissez-faire attitude to societal structure, Murteta prioritizes rules, order, and strict hierarchy. With more rigorous vetting of newcomers and higher standards demanded of residents, Murteta sees itself as the true spine of Toledo. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>穆尔泰塔对斯佩兰扎在社会结构上的放任态度感到不满，因此优先强调规则、秩序和严格的等级制度。通过对新来者更严格的审查和对居民更高的要求，穆尔泰塔视自己为托雷多真正的脊梁。 </p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/79ed97a8-deca-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul-sOffering_03-1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/79ed97a8-deca-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul'sOffering_03.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Made up of structured survivalists, the Contrada asks a lot of those who make it their home, but offers an enviable level of luxury to those that rise in its ranks. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>这个城区由有组织的生存主义者组成，对那些在此安家的人要求很高，但也为那些在阶层中崛起的人提供了令人艳羡的奢华生活。 </p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Celeste has witnessed Murteta’s attitude to the other Contradas continue to harden. She hopes to ease the tension by honoring their fallen Raiders. Help her collect an offering that celebrates their contribution to Toledo’s enduring safety.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>塞莱斯特目睹了穆尔泰塔对其他城区的态度持续强硬。她希望通过纪念他们逝去的奇袭者来缓和紧张局势。帮她收集一份祭品，以表彰他们对托雷多持久安全所做的贡献。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Ferrovia</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>费罗维亚街区</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The intellectual heart of Toledo. Founded by the original engineers of the reinvigorated tube network, Ferrovia boasts the most creative and shrewd of Toledo’s citizens. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>托雷多的智慧中心。由振兴地铁网络的首批工程师创立，费罗维亚街区拥有托雷多最具创造力和精明头脑的公民。 </p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/a846806d-5aef-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul-sOffering_02-1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/a846806d-5aef-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul'sOffering_02.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Ferrovia has become a refuge for the gifted… and the devious. Made up of artists, engineers, traders, and smugglers, the neighborhood is a crucible of talent. A renaissance of brilliant minds has flowered in Ferrovia, some of whom were instrumental in building the Ballistic Gondolas. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>费罗维亚街区已成为天才……以及狡诈之徒的庇护所。这里汇聚了艺术家、工程师、商人和走私者，这个街区是才华的熔炉。杰出思想的复兴在费罗维亚街区绽放，其中一些人曾在建造弹道吊舱中发挥了重要作用。 </p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Celeste wants to recognize their contribution to opening Pendola Pass, and she needs your help gathering items for their lantern-inspired offering. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>塞莱斯特希望认可他们为打通彭多拉山口所做的贡献，她需要你帮忙收集物品，制作他们受灯笼启发的祭品。 </p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Vaulto</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>沃尔托</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Little is known about the Contrada of Vaulto. As Toledo’s most secretive neighborhood, information about what happens inside is limited to whispered stories and hand-written notes</p>",
    "zh": "<p>关于沃尔托城区，人们知之甚少。作为托雷多最神秘的街区，有关其内部情况的信息仅限于耳语传闻和手写笔记。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/23e1038c-21d0-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul-sOffering_01-1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/23e1038c-21d0-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul'sOffering_01.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Regardless, Celeste holds them in high esteem; their sophisticated jamming technology interferes with ARC’s signals and protects Toledo from detection. Raiders from Vaulto are rarely seen on the surface, implying that their Topside expeditions are meticulously planned, efficient, and infrequent. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>尽管如此，塞莱斯特对他们极为敬重；他们精密的干扰技术能干扰ARC的信号，保护托雷多不被探测。沃尔托的奇袭者很少出现在地表，这意味着他们的上层远征经过精心策划、高效且不频繁。 </p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>What you don’t know <em>can </em>hurt you. At least, that’s what Celeste believes. She wants to form a point of communication with Vaulto, starting with an offering to celebrate their fallen Raiders. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>你不知道的事<em>确实可能</em>伤害你。至少，塞莱斯特是这么认为的。她希望与沃尔托建立沟通渠道，从献上一份祭品以纪念他们逝去的奇袭者开始。 </p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Make your offering</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>献上你的祭品</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The Soul’s Offering is the perfect opportunity to build goodwill with Speranza’s neighbors, and hopefully, learn more about them. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>奉灵节是与斯佩兰扎的邻居们建立善意的绝佳机会，或许还能更多地了解他们。 </p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Unnurtured relationships begin to rot… then they fall apart. In the spirit of tolerance and togetherness, aid Celeste in strengthening the bonds throughout Toledo, before it’s too late. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>未经培育的关系会开始腐烂……然后分崩离析。本着宽容与团结的精神，帮助塞莱斯特在一切为时已晚之前，加强整个托雷多的纽带。 </p>"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "live-update-2-3-0",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/live-update-2-3-0",
  "date": "2026-10-27",
  "tags": [
   "Patch Notes"
  ],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/8c2ebd84-592b-live-update-2.3-card-600x200-600x200.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "Live Update 2.3.0",
   "zh": "实时更新 2.3.0"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/9728c917-eb20-ARC-Raiders_Steam_EventHeader_LiveUpdate_1920x622-20-3--1024x332.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/9728c917-eb20-ARC-Raiders_Steam_EventHeader_LiveUpdate_1920x622%20(3).jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"332\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Raiders!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>奇袭者们！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Update 2.3 is rolling out right now with the Noxious Set, a number of fixes and a new player project! Please restart the game to download.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>2.3更新现已推出，包含毒性套装、多项修复以及一个全新的玩家项目！请重启游戏以下载更新。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Since Frozen Trail has released, we have been including fixes in our weekly updates. After today we will go back to the regular schedule of fixes every three weeks and store updates on a weekly basis.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>自霜痕小径发布以来，我们一直在每周更新中加入修复。今天之后，我们将恢复每三周一次修复、每周更新商店的常规安排。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/427ebfa6-ed3a-T_UI_StoreTile_Noxious_16_9-1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/427ebfa6-ed3a-T_UI_StoreTile_Noxious_16_9.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>New Player Project: Souls Offering</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>新玩家项目：灵魂祭品</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>While the four contradas of Toledo can’t agree on much, one thing they all have in common are the losses they’ve suffered topside. As brutal stories from Pendola Pass trickle into the cantinas, Celeste is encouraging members of Speranza to pause and honor the fallen. Remember each fallen Raider for who they were, and the dents they were able to make in ARC’s onslaught. Each offering is unique, but all who pause in reverence share in their Soul’s Offering. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>尽管托雷多的四个城区在许多事情上难以达成一致，但他们在上层所遭受的损失却是共同的。随着彭多拉山口的残酷故事逐渐传入酒馆，塞莱斯特正鼓励斯佩兰扎的成员们停下脚步，向逝者致敬。铭记每一位逝去的奇袭者本来的模样，以及他们在ARC的攻势中所留下的痕迹。每一份祭品都是独一无二的，但所有怀着敬意驻足的人，都在共享他们的灵魂祭品。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/fd0f24d7-7d19-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul-sOffering_03-20-1--1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/fd0f24d7-7d19-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul'sOffering_03%20(1).jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Content and Bug Fixes</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>内容与错误修复</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>ARC</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>ARC</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Adjusted loot distribution in the Emperor. Containers near the entrance now yield lower-tier rewards, with higher-tier loot placed deeper inside.</li><li>Fixed a case where rolling enemies would continue to lay tracks after they died.</li><li>Improved the way ARC move when they are close to the borders of the map.</li><li>Fixed an issue where players could stand on the Skulker indefinitely.</li><li>Adjusted Vaporizer debris so they no longer fly away or jitter; responses now better match their weight and size.</li><li>Added new visual hatches to make it easier to see how far the Frigate puzzle has progressed.</li><li>Fixed missing collision on the Frigate that allowed players to enter or hide inside geometry, and prevented players getting stuck on the wings.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>调整了帝王内部的战利品分布。入口附近的容器现在产出较低阶奖励，高阶战利品则放置在更深处。</li><li>修复了翻滚中的敌人死亡后仍会继续留下痕迹的问题。</li><li>改进了ARC接近地图边界时的移动方式。</li><li>修复了玩家可以无限期站在潜伏者身上的问题。</li><li>调整了汽化者残骸，使其不再飞走或抖动；物理反应现在更符合其重量和尺寸。</li><li>新增了可视化舱口，以便更清楚地查看护卫者谜题的进度。</li><li>修复了护卫者上缺失的碰撞体，该问题曾允许玩家进入或藏入几何体内部，并防止玩家卡在机翼上。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Animation</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>动画</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Minor animation adjustment to the Bull Rush skill’s camera animation on hit. </li><li>Fixed an issue where magazines did not eject during reloads on Bettina, Bobcat, and Kettle.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>对野蛮冲撞技能命中时的镜头动画进行了小幅调整。</li><li>修复了贝蒂娜、山猫和水壶在装填弹药时弹匣未弹出的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Audio</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>音频</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Added clearer audio cues on the Frigate’s power core vents and hatches to better signal progression, completion, and destruction states.</li><li>Added sound effects when picking up and placing furniture in the Outpost, including when returning furniture to its original slot.</li><li>Refined audio for Outpost crafting, placement, progress, and removal.</li><li>Fixed an issue where cloth would not simulate correctly.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>为护卫者的能量核心通风口和舱口增加了更清晰的音频提示，以更好地传达进度、完成和摧毁状态。</li><li>在哨站中拾取和放置家具时添加了音效，包括将家具放回原位时。</li><li>优化了哨站制作、放置、进度和移除的音频。</li><li>修复了布料无法正确模拟的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>玩法</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>General</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>通用</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where downed Raiders continued to lose health after entering the Ballistic Gondola.</li><li>Increased Heavy Shield base charge value from 80 to 90.</li><li><ul><li>Dev Note: We experimented with some small buffs to the Heavy Shield in the 2.0 update, and the data is showing us that the durability drain rate in particular showed marked changes. The usage rates for this shield are still relatively low, so we’re giving it another little bump, this time in the base charge value. This will slightly increase survivability against most weapons, without creating too large a margin between the Heavy and Medium Shields. We will continue to monitor the use of our various low-use equipment to try and find a balance that works for both usability and the overall game health, and will be monitoring this change closely for any unintended changes to overall combat balance.</li></ul></li><li>When on or near the Frigate, pings now mark the exact location instead of labeling the Frigate.</li><li>Expanded on the exploit prevention feature used in locked rooms to provide a more fair experience inside the Emperor.</li><li>Blocked placing barricade kits where they intersect with solid walls or in spaces that are too tight.</li><li>Tweaked killboxes at the top of the compactor inside the Emperor in Pendola Pass to eliminate some scenarios where players would be unfairly killed.</li><li>Fixed an issue where heavy landings weren’t being triggered correctly when dodgerolling or when already in a heavy landing.and where retriggering a  heavy landing during a Dodge Roll could negate fall damage; heavy landings now trigger correctly while rolling.</li><li>Fixed an issue where Scrappy would rotate in the Outpost outside of customization.</li><li>Fixed an issue where Scrappy would not appear in the Outpost until entering the Workshop or customization.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了倒地的奇袭者进入弹道吊舱后仍持续失去生命值的问题。</li><li>将重型护盾的基础充能值从80提升至90。</li><li><ul><li>开发者注：我们在2.0更新中尝试了对重型护盾的一些小幅增强，数据显示耐久消耗速率尤其出现了显著变化。该护盾的使用率仍然相对较低，因此我们再次给予小幅提升，这次是在基础充能值上。这将略微提高对大多数武器的生存能力，同时不会在重型和中性护盾之间拉开过大差距。我们将继续监测各种低使用率装备的使用情况，以寻求兼顾可用性与整体游戏健康度的平衡，并会密切关注此改动是否会无意中影响整体战斗平衡。</li></ul></li><li>当位于护卫者上或其附近时，标记现在会标记精确位置，而不再标记护卫者本身。</li><li>扩展了上锁房间中使用的防作弊功能，以在帝王内部提供更公平的体验。</li><li>阻止在路障工具与实心墙体相交或空间过窄的位置放置路障工具。</li><li>调整了彭多拉山口帝国内压实机顶部的击杀区域，以消除部分玩家被不公平击杀的情况。</li><li>修复了翻滚闪避时或已处于重落地状态时，重落地未被正确触发，以及在翻滚闪避期间重新触发重落地可能抵消坠落伤害的问题；重落地现在会在翻滚时正确触发。</li><li>修复了废品仔在哨站中会在自定义界面外旋转的问题。</li><li>修复了废品仔在进入工坊或自定义界面之前不会出现在哨站中的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Frigate</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>护卫者</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>You can now ping the Frigate from long range while it is entering the area.</li><li>Adjusted loot distribution so areas further in have a higher chance of higher-tier rewards; </li><li>Updated the cargo gate to a newer version.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>护卫者进入区域时，现在可以从远距离进行标记。</li><li>调整了战利品分布，使更深入区域的更高阶奖励出现几率更高；</li><li>将货舱门更新为新版本。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/e856d960-0278-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul-sOffering_02-20-1--1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/e856d960-0278-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul'sOffering_02%20(1).jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3><strong>Items</strong></h3>",
    "zh": "<h3><strong>物品</strong></h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where mines could be placed on dismantling barricades, causing them to float in midair.</li><li>Fixed an issue where fire from Flame Spray could pass through a wall.</li><li>Increased Flame Spray damage to 13/s (from 10/s) and reduced durability drain by 50%.</li><li>The Firefly Burner now activates on impact when thrown, traveling while leaving a trail of fire before exploding after about 3 seconds. Previously, it had to be shot to vent fire.</li><li>You can now use Adrenaline Shot even at max stamina. Its effect no longer stacks; using another Adrenaline Shot refreshes the duration.</li><li>Fixed inverted drop rates for furniture Designs; rarer items now drop less frequently.</li><li>Dolabra, Bobcat, Equalizer, Jupiter, Tempest, and Vulcano blueprints can now drop in any major map condition. Slightly lowered the drop chance of that pool to account for the increased value.</li><li>Reduced the drop chance of the Emperor Key blueprint from Redirection pods, and added a small chance to find ARC parts and high-tier ARC loot to compensate.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了地雷可以放置在正被拆除的路障上，导致其悬浮在空中的问题。</li><li>修复了火焰喷涂的火焰可以穿过墙壁的问题。</li><li>将火焰喷涂的伤害从10/秒提高至13/秒，并将耐用性消耗降低50%。</li><li>“萤火虫”燃烧炉现在被投掷后会在撞击时激活，飞行时留下火焰轨迹，并在约3秒后爆炸。此前，它需要被击中才会喷出火焰。</li><li>现在即使耐力已满也可以使用肾上腺素针剂。其效果不再叠加；再次使用肾上腺素针剂会刷新持续时间。</li><li>修复了家具设计图掉落率颠倒的问题；稀有物品现在掉落频率更低。</li><li>錾斧、山猫、制裁者、木星、风暴和火山的蓝图现在可以在任何主要地图条件中掉落。鉴于价值提升，略微降低了该池的掉落几率。</li><li>降低了航向重定向舱中帝王钥匙蓝图的掉落几率，并增加了少量获得ARC零件和高阶ARC战利品的机会作为补偿。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Grappling Hook</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>钩爪</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where the Grappling Hook could not be used inside the Matriarch’s shield while it was active.</li><li>Tether items now affect players swinging from the grappling hook.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the Grappling Hook could launch players at extreme speeds or into the air when the line snagged on geometry, reducing unintended launches and falls.</li><li>Grappling hook now reattaches to debris when its target breaks apart, improving reliability when grappling destroyed ARC parts.</li><li>Fixed an issue where reeling an ARC with the Grappling Hook while the rope was wrapped around an obstacle pulled it toward the player instead of the wrap point; targets now reel toward the rope as intended, preventing unintended high‑speed launches.</li><li>Fixed an issue that allowed reeling in the Grappling Hook while firing was blocked, which could also corrupt the animation during a Dodge Roll.</li><li>Fixed a bug where the hand animation could get stuck after swapping from a thrown Grappling Hook to another item.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了族母护盾激活时无法在其内部使用钩爪的问题。</li><li>束缚物品现在会影响使用钩爪摆荡的玩家。</li><li>修复了钩爪绳索卡在几何体上时可能导致玩家以极快速度飞出或弹向空中的问题，减少了意外发射和坠落。</li><li>当目标破碎时，钩爪现在会重新附着到残骸上，提高了钩住被摧毁的ARC部件时的可靠性。</li><li>修复了当绳子缠绕在障碍物上时，用钩爪拖拽ARC会将其拉向玩家而非缠绕点的问题；目标现在会按预期朝绳子方向被拖拽，防止意外的高速发射。</li><li>修复了在射击被阻挡时仍可收回钩爪的问题，该问题还可能在翻滚闪避期间破坏动画。</li><li>修复了从已投掷的钩爪切换到其他物品后手部动画可能卡住的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Camera</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>相机</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Added Color Push and Black &amp; White filters to the advanced Camera.</li><li>Refined the film grain texture on the Classic Film filter.</li><li>Reduced depth-of-field blur on the Basic Camera to make selfies clearer.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>为高级相机添加了色彩增强和黑白滤镜。</li><li>优化了经典胶片滤镜的胶片颗粒质感。</li><li>减少了简易相机的景深模糊，使自拍更清晰。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Zipline</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>滑索</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where entering a zipline from the ground would not move the character upward, making attachments behave oddly. Characters now move upward correctly on entry.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the Zipline preview cable could disappear when aiming at very long distances.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了从地面进入滑索时角色不会向上移动，导致附着行为异常的问题。角色现在进入时会正确向上移动。</li><li>修复了瞄准极远距离时滑索预览缆绳可能消失的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Map</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>地图</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Pendola Pass</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>彭多拉山口</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed multiple collision issues around the fallen Emperor in Pendola Pass to reduce getting stuck, missing collisions, and unintended out-of-bounds access.</li><li>Fixed an issue where players could sometimes clip through the gondola extraction on Pendola Pass.</li><li>Fixed missing ceiling collision in the Fallen Emperor on Pendola Pass that allowed players to leave the playable space.</li><li>Removed chairs in a shelter that could block looting due to collision issues.</li><li>Improved the placement of some containers inside the Storm Huts of Pendola Pass, which also fixes an issue with one of them where a Medical Bag could be interacted with through a wall.</li><li>Fixed an issue with an ammo box in Pendola Pass not being interactable.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了彭多拉山口陨落帝王周围的多个碰撞问题，以减少卡住、碰撞缺失和意外越界访问。</li><li>修复了玩家有时可能穿过彭多拉山口吊舱撤离点的问题。</li><li>修复了彭多拉山口陨落帝王中缺失的天花板碰撞体，该问题曾允许玩家离开可游玩空间。</li><li>移除了避难所中因碰撞问题可能阻挡搜刮的椅子。</li><li>改进了彭多拉山口风暴小屋中部分容器的摆放，同时也修复了其中一个医疗包可以隔着墙互动的问题。</li><li>修复了彭多拉山口一个弹药箱无法互动的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Spaceport</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>太空港</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue on Spaceport where players could get stuck when trying to pass through a small fence gap.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了太空港上玩家试图通过一个小栅栏缺口时可能卡住的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Stella Montis</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>星辰山</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed various locations on Stella Montis where players could get stuck.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了星辰山上多处玩家可能卡住的位置。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Performance</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>性能</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Updated FidelityFX Super Resolution (FSR) plugin to version 4.1.1.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>将FidelityFX超分辨率（FSR）插件更新至4.1.1版本。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Quest</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>任务</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where Daily Quests did not refresh in the menus after they expired.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了每日任务过期后菜单中未刷新的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Stability</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>稳定性</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Reduced audio memory usage on Xbox Series S to improve stability and mitigate out-of-memory crashes, particularly when navigating around the Frigate.</li><li>Fixed an issue that could cause players to get stuck in the tunnel sequence after finishing a round; a failsafe now returns you to the front end if the end-of-round survey screen fails to load.</li><li>Added a workaround that mitigates a ray tracing related GPU crash on AMD RX 7000 series GPUs.</li><li>Reduced memory usage for the Frigate to address rare crashes when exploring its cargo hold with larger groups.</li><li>Improved stability when exploring the Frigate, reducing the chance of crashes.</li><li>Fixed a rare crash that could occur while using voice chat, improving overall voice chat stability.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>降低Xbox Series S上的音频内存占用，以提高稳定性并缓解内存不足崩溃，尤其是在护卫者附近移动时。</li><li>修复了完成一局后玩家可能卡在隧道动画中的问题；现在如果回合结束调查画面加载失败，会有一个安全机制将你送回前端。</li><li>添加了一个缓解AMD RX 7000系列GPU上光线追踪相关崩溃的临时方案。</li><li>降低了护卫者的内存占用，以解决大型队伍探索其货舱时偶尔出现的崩溃。</li><li>提高了探索护卫者时的稳定性，降低了崩溃几率。</li><li>修复了使用语音聊天时可能发生的罕见崩溃，提高了语音聊天的整体稳定性。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/37a5d474-7dfd-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul-sOffering_01-20-1--1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/37a5d474-7dfd-ArcRaiders_SoMe_ScreenShot_16x9-Soul'sOffering_01%20(1).jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>UI</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>UI</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>General</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>通用</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>We will be disabling the Expedition Vault and you will receive Bronze Statuettes as compensation for the purchased slots. Everything you had in the Vault will be moved to your stash.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the HUD did not show the correct controller input hint for the Raider Tool and melee; it now displays the appropriate icon and Hold indicator based on your binding.</li><li>Camera HUD now extends to the edges of widescreen displays for a cleaner full-screen view.</li><li>The End of Round screen now correctly shows attached Weapon Mods and applied Stencils; tooltips correctly display applied Stencil info.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the mouse cursor could become confined to a small area after using the radial wheel with a controller, causing restricted cursor movement in inventory and looting interfaces when switching between mouse and controller.</li><li>Added animated transitions and a subtle glint effect to collection items in menus to improve visual feedback.</li><li>Unified On/Off toggle order in outfit customization: ON now appears first and OFF last across all items.</li><li>Added a camera bob option in Gameplay settings.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the health bar could display a healing preview while downed.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>我们将停用远征储物库，你将获得青铜小雕像作为已购槽位的补偿。储物库中的所有物品都将移入你的储备箱。</li><li>修复了HUD未正确显示奇袭工具和近战的控制器输入提示的问题；现在会根据你的按键绑定显示相应图标和按住指示。</li><li>相机HUD现在会延伸至宽屏显示器边缘，提供更干净的全屏视图。</li><li>回合结束画面现在会正确显示已装配的武器改装和已应用的模板；提示框会正确显示已应用模板的信息。</li><li>修复了使用手柄操作径向菜单后，鼠标光标可能被限制在小范围内，导致在鼠标和手柄切换时物品栏和搜刮界面中光标移动受限的问题。</li><li>为菜单中的收藏品添加了动画过渡和微光效果，以改善视觉反馈。</li><li>统一了外观自定义中的开关切换顺序：所有物品的“开”现在显示在前，“关”显示在后。</li><li>在玩法设置中添加了镜头摆动选项。</li><li>修复了倒地时生命条可能显示治疗预览的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Codex</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>百科</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where the selected Codex entry could be cut off in the sidebar; the selected entry now remains visible when scrolling.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the Codex entry for “Bilguun’s Hideout” did not unlock after visiting it on Spaceport.</li><li>Updated the Basic and Advanced Camera tooltips to clarify where saved photos can be viewed in the Codex.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了所选百科条目在侧栏中可能被截断的问题；滚动时所选条目现在保持可见。</li><li>修复了在太空港参观后“比尔根的藏身处”百科条目未解锁的问题。</li><li>更新了简易相机和高级相机的提示框，以说明保存的照片可在百科中的何处查看。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Outpost</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>哨站</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Improved framing of Outpost furniture icons for clearer previews.</li><li>When placing furniture in the Outpost, camera cycling now skips views that don’t show a compatible slot for the selected item.</li><li>Fixed a camera issue at the Workshop Bench slot near the Outpost door that caused the view to clip through the wall.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>改进了哨站家具图标的取景，使预览更清晰。</li><li>在哨站中放置家具时，镜头循环现在会跳过未显示所选物品兼容槽位的视角。</li><li>修复了哨站门旁工坊工作台槽位的镜头问题，该问题曾导致视角穿墙。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Reward Pass</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>奖励通行证</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Improved the Reward Pass upgrade screen: standardized panel heights, adjusted padding, and capitalized &quot;Includes:&quot;; list items are larger to better support longer translations.</li><li>Updated the Reward Pass screen: improved the Feats panel layout, renamed Daily Feats to Feats and Weekly Bonus to Milestones, and refined timers for better readability.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>改进了奖励通行证升级界面：统一了面板高度，调整了内边距，并将“Includes:”改为大写；列表项更大，以更好地支持较长的翻译。</li><li>更新了奖励通行证界面：改进了功绩面板布局，将每日功绩更名为功绩，每周奖励更名为里程碑，并优化了计时器的可读性。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Weapon Amplification</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>武器增强</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>In the Amplification tree, branch points now list the specific amplifications they would block in the tooltip, replacing the generic exclusivity message.</li><li>The Amplify button in the Weapon Bench upgrade tab now shows its keybind when using keyboard and mouse.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>在增强树中，分支节点现在会在工具提示中列出它们会阻止的具体增强，取代了通用的互斥说明。</li><li>武器工作台升级选项卡中的增强按钮现在在使用键盘和鼠标时会显示其键位。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Project</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>计划</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Resolved cases where the yellow dot on the Projects tab persisted after checking or starting projects.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>解决了在查看或开始计划后，计划选项卡上的黄点仍然存在的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Workshop</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>工坊</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Reordered the Workshop subnavigation to match the tile order, placing Basic Workbench immediately after Scrappy.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>重新排列了工坊的子导航以匹配磁贴顺序，将基础工作台紧接在废品仔之后。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>VFX</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>视觉特效</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Improved volumetric smoke visuals by reducing jitter and ensuring effects align more accurately with smoke density, resulting in more stable and coherent VFX</li><li>Improvements to skin shading.</li><li>Improved one of our ambient occlusion techniques that should significantly reduce ghosting and flickering of ambient occlusion in some areas</li><li>Added missing downwash visual effects when the Ballistic Gondola takes off.</li><li>Improved lighting on Frigates by preserving global illumination to prevent overly dark interiors.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>改进了体积烟雾视觉效果，减少了抖动，并确保效果与烟雾密度更准确地对齐，从而带来更稳定、更连贯的视觉特效。</li><li>改进了皮肤着色。</li><li>改进了我们的一种环境光遮蔽技术，这应能显著减少某些区域环境光遮蔽的残影和闪烁。</li><li>添加了弹道吊舱起飞时缺失的下洗气流视觉效果。</li><li>通过保留全局光照来改进护卫者的光照，以防止内部过于黑暗。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Known Issues</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>已知问题</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>The Raider Tool has the default skin even when other skins are equipped.</li><li>Extracting with partial progress of ‘To The Skies’ quest may result in an inability to complete it.</li><li>‘When Everything Falls’ - some quest objectives, such as “Photograph Port A” may not complete for some players.</li><li>In some instances, if players lose or sell quest items, such as the Equatorial Sundial needed for ‘Clean Hands’, the quest cannot be completed.</li><li>Some XBOX players may experience instability or crashes.</li><li>ARC Reclaimers can occasionally fail to dock on the appropriate spot on the Frigate.</li><li>When vaulting on an ARC Reclaimer, the player can be mistakenly pushed off.</li><li>Occasionally, some weapon models may increase in size dramatically during a raid.</li><li>Falling while using the Grappling Hook can cause the player to “bounce” high into the air.</li><li>There is a spot around the Railroad on Pendola Pass where players can get stuck.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>即使装备了其他皮肤，奇袭工具仍显示默认皮肤。</li><li>在“飞向苍穹”任务中带着部分进度撤离，可能会导致无法完成该任务。</li><li>“万物崩塌之时” - 某些任务目标（例如“拍摄A港”）对部分玩家可能无法完成。</li><li>在某些情况下，如果玩家丢失或出售任务物品（例如“清理指针”所需的赤道日晷），则任务无法完成。</li><li>部分XBOX玩家可能会遇到不稳定或崩溃。</li><li>ARC回收者偶尔可能无法停靠在护卫者上的适当位置。</li><li>在ARC回收者上翻越时，玩家可能会被错误地推下去。</li><li>在突袭期间，某些武器模型偶尔会急剧增大。</li><li>使用钩爪时坠落可能导致玩家“弹跳”到很高的空中。</li><li>在彭多拉山口的铁路附近有一处玩家可能会卡住的地方。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>See you Topside,<br>The ARC Raiders Team</p>",
    "zh": "<p>上层见，<br>ARC Raiders团队</p>"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "speranza-security-recruitment",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/speranza-security-recruitment",
  "date": "2026-10-20",
  "tags": [],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/a030fcbc-2f29-gondola-operator-card-600x200-600x200.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "Speranza Security Recruitment",
   "zh": "斯佩兰扎安保区招募"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/24ed5af2-4371-Header_1600x400_02-1024x256.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/24ed5af2-4371-Header_1600x400_02.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"256\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Speranza needs YOU! </strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>斯佩兰扎需要你！</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>With ARC activity ramping up and Raiders pushing into new Northern Frontiers, Speranza Security is stretched thin. Tube Operators are working overtime, so Shani is recruiting new workers to get Raiders home safely from Pendola Pass.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>随着ARC活动日益频繁，奇袭者不断向新的北方边境推进，斯佩兰扎安保区人手紧缺。管道操作员们正加班加点，因此萨尼正在招募新员工，帮助奇袭者从彭多拉山口安全返回家园。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>That’s where you come in, Raider - join the Speranza Security team and lend your voice to the new Gondola extract!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>奇袭者，这就是你登场的时候——加入斯佩兰扎安保团队，为新的吊舱撤离献声吧！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Send us a recording of your voice lines for a chance to be selected as a new Gondola operator, guiding frozen Raiders back to their warm home. We’ll select the best lines to be added into ARC Raiders, bringing your voice into the Rust Belt and rewarding you with Raider Tokens for your efforts. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>把你录制的语音台词发给我们，就有机会被选为新的吊舱操作员，引导冻僵的奇袭者回到温暖的家。我们会挑选最棒的台词加入ARC Raiders，让你的声音响彻锈带，并奖励你奇袭者代币，感谢你的付出。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Submit your line for either of these two categories:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>请从以下两个类别中任选其一提交你的台词：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Category A - Scripted</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>A类——指定台词</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Record one of these Gondola operator lines:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>录制以下吊舱操作员台词中的一句：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>“Let&#x27;s see, I have... Yes, on its way. Looks like it&#x27;s going to go... Northeast. Yes, start heading northeast.”</li><li>“Sending a Gondola, Raider. Looks like it&#x27;s heading... East of you. Yes, it&#x27;s going east.”</li><li>“Let me see what I can do... All right, coming your way. Start heading southeast.”</li><li>“Ballistic gondola, on the way. Let&#x27;s see where it&#x27;s... All right, should be landing south of you.”</li><li>“Got your signal. Gondola is taking off, and... Let&#x27;s see... Heading to your southwest. Repeat: to your southwest.”</li><li>“It&#x27;s coming your way, Raider. Flight path&#x27;s looking good. Should be landing west of you.” </li><li>“Let&#x27;s get you home, Raider. There&#x27;s a Gondola headed your way. Should be there soon - head northwest if you want to catch it.”</li><li>“Call received. Ballistic Gondola on the way to... To the north of you, looks like. Yes, start going north.”</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>“让我看看，我这里有……好的，正在路上。看起来它会飞向……东北方。没错，开始往东北方向走。”</li><li>“奇袭者，正在为你发送吊舱。看起来它的落点在你……东边。没错，会落在东边。”</li><li>“让我看看能做什么……好，正在朝你那边去。开始往东南方向走。”</li><li>“弹道吊舱，正在路上。让我看看它会落在……好的，应该会降落在你的南边。”</li><li>“收到你的信号。吊舱已经起飞，而且……让我看看……正前往你的西南方。重复：你的西南方。”</li><li>“奇袭者，它正朝你那边去。飞行路径看起来不错。应该会降落在你的西边。”</li><li>“奇袭者，让我们送你回家。有一架吊舱正朝你那边去。应该很快就到——想赶上它就往西北方走。”</li><li>“呼叫已收到。弹道吊舱正在前往……看起来是你北边。没错，开始向北走。”</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Category B - Original</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>B类——原创台词</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Write and record your own original extraction operator line in accordance with the guidance below. You can use the lines in category A as inspiration:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>按照以下指引，撰写并录制你自己的原创撤离操作员台词。你可以参考A类台词寻找灵感：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>What your character knows: </p>",
    "zh": "<p>你的角色所知信息：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>A Raider has requested a Ballistic Gondola, from a specific, known transceiver around Pendola Pass.</li><li>You can roughly predict where the Gondola will land relative to the transceiver’s position, but it’s far from accurate.</li><li>You need to convey to the Raider one of eight compass directions of where the Gondola will land (north, northeast, east, southeast, south, southwest, west, or northwest).</li><li>You do not know which Raider called in the Gondola. More broadly, you do not know the majority of Raiders on a personal level. </li><li>Raiders can not speak to you, nor do you have any eyes on the surface.</li><li>Ballistic Gondolas are a new, experimental technology, so all operators are figuring out how to operate them as they go.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>一名奇袭者通过彭多拉山口附近一个特定的已知收发器请求了一架弹道吊舱。</li><li>你能大致预测吊舱相对于收发器位置的降落地点，但远远谈不上精确。</li><li>你需要向奇袭者传达吊舱将降落的八个罗盘方向之一（北、东北、东、东南、南、西南、西或西北）。</li><li>你不知道是哪位奇袭者呼叫的吊舱。更广泛地说，你并不认识大多数奇袭者。</li><li>奇袭者无法与你对话，你也看不到地表情况。</li><li>弹道吊舱是一项全新的实验性技术，所以所有操作员都在摸索中学习如何操作。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Examples of character choices you can make:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>你可以做出的角色设定示例：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>How has today’s shift been so far? Are you stressed; excited; overwhelmed; determined?</li><li>How new are you to the job? Is this your usual role, or are you filling in for someone else?</li><li>How do you feel about Raiders? Do you consider them arrogant and difficult to work with, or do they inspire you?</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>今天的班次到目前为止怎么样？你是感到压力大、兴奋、不堪重负，还是意志坚定？</li><li>你对这份工作有多陌生？这是你的常规岗位，还是你临时顶替别人？</li><li>你对奇袭者有什么看法？你觉得他们傲慢难相处，还是他们激励了你？</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Guidelines on phrasing and tonality: </p>",
    "zh": "<p>措辞和语气指引：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Remember, ARC Raiders is set in the future! This means operators do not use contemporary slang.</li><li>Avoid mentioning the weather – the line may be heard in a range of different weather conditions.</li><li>Avoid referencing the presence of specific ARC machines, as this too may vary across rounds.</li><li>Operators never introduce themselves by name.</li><li>Operators are civilians, not Raiders. They do not go Topside themselves, and most of their knowledge is second-hand.</li><li>Of course, operators live inside our game world. This means out-of-game references are strictly forbidden.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>请记住，ARC Raiders设定在未来！这意味着操作员不会使用当代俚语。</li><li>避免提及天气——这条台词可能会在各种不同天气条件下被听到。</li><li>避免提及特定ARC机器的存在，因为这在各轮游戏中也会有所不同。</li><li>操作员从不自我介绍姓名。</li><li>操作员是平民，不是奇袭者。他们自己不会去上层，大部分知识都是间接获得的。</li><li>当然，操作员生活在我们的游戏世界中。这意味着严禁出现游戏外的引用。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Submission guidelines</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>提交指南</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Your submitted audio clip should be 10 seconds maximum.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>你提交的音频片段最长不得超过10秒。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Submissions containing the following will be filtered out:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>包含以下内容的提交将被筛除：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Hateful and/or political dog whistles, including obscure or local ones.</li><li>Any religious phrases or references</li><li>Any contemporary slang, including ‘clankers’</li><li>Any out-of-fiction references, including:</li><li><ul><li>streamers&#x27; inside jokes or catchphrases</li><li>references to other games </li><li>references to pop culture</li><li>memes and trending audio </li></ul></li><li>Any lines referencing present-day AI developments or culture</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>仇恨言论和/或政治暗语，包括隐晦或地方性的暗语。</li><li>任何宗教用语或引用</li><li>任何当代俚语，包括“clankers”</li><li>任何虚构世界之外的引用，包括：</li><li><ul><li>主播的内部梗或口头禅</li><li>对其他游戏的引用</li><li>对流行文化的引用</li><li>梗图和热门音频</li></ul></li><li>任何提及当今AI发展或文化的台词</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2><strong>Submit your audio</strong></h2>",
    "zh": "<h2><strong>提交你的音频</strong></h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Upload your 10 second max audio clip submission (WAV Format) here:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>在这里上传你最长10秒的音频片段（WAV格式）：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeDX9utscbyVdlfrlaLTEg4gqygaJTOTMgvlSPaWFxc_nH97g/viewform?usp=header\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[Submission form link]</a></p>",
    "zh": "<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeDX9utscbyVdlfrlaLTEg4gqygaJTOTMgvlSPaWFxc_nH97g/viewform?usp=header\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[提交表单链接]</a></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>For the best chance to be selected, check out this handy guide on how to record audio at home:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>为了获得更高的入选机会，请查看这份在家录制音频的实用指南：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>[<a href=\"https://id.embark.games/arc-raiders/support/faq/287-how-to-record-dialogue-at-home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Audio Home recording Guide link</a>]</p>",
    "zh": "<p>[<a href=\"https://id.embark.games/arc-raiders/support/faq/287-how-to-record-dialogue-at-home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">家庭音频录制指南链接</a>]</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Read the full list of terms and conditions <a href=\"https://id.embark.games/arc-raiders/support/faq/285-speranza-security-recruitment-community-competition---official-rules\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. Our <a href=\"https://id.embark.games/arc-raiders/support/faq/286-speranza-security-recruitment-community-competition---privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Privacy Policy</a> applies.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>点击<a href=\"https://id.embark.games/arc-raiders/support/faq/285-speranza-security-recruitment-community-competition---official-rules\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">此处</a>阅读完整条款与条件。我们的<a href=\"https://id.embark.games/arc-raiders/support/faq/286-speranza-security-recruitment-community-competition---privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">隐私政策</a>适用。</p>"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "pve-test-thanks-for-playing",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/pve-test-thanks-for-playing",
  "date": "2026-10-20",
  "tags": [],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/4382ddb0-bfc3-pve-toggle-card-600x200-600x200.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "PvE Matchmaking Toggle Test: Thanks for taking part!",
   "zh": "PvE 匹配开关测试：感谢参与！"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The limited-time PvE matchmaking toggle test has ended - we want to thank everyone that came to take part and who provided us with valuable data and insights.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>限时 PvE 匹配开关测试已结束——我们想感谢所有参与其中并为我们提供宝贵数据与见解的玩家。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>More than 30 million rounds of PvE were played over the testing period - this gives us a huge amount of information to analyze! As such, we’re going to need a short period of time to dive into the numbers and draw out the insights. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>测试期间共进行了超过 3000 万局 PvE——这为我们提供了海量信息可供分析！因此，我们需要一小段时间来深入研究数据并提炼见解。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>We also want to collect your personal thoughts and reflections from the test. How did PvE differ from your normal experience? What could be improved? How did the typical PvPvE experience change during the test? Submit your thoughts through the <a href=\"https://discordapp.com/channels/1107589599045361695/1559498786290663585\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PvE-test-feedback channel in Discord</a>! We will also be sending out a survey to a representative sample of ARC Raiders players from October 22.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>我们也想收集你对本次测试的个人想法与反思。PvE 与你的常规体验有何不同？哪些方面可以改进？测试期间典型的 PvPvE 体验发生了怎样的变化？请通过 <a href=\"https://discordapp.com/channels/1107589599045361695/1559498786290663585\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Discord 中的 PvE 测试反馈频道</a>提交你的想法！我们还将从 10 月 22 日起向具有代表性的 ARC Raiders 玩家样本发送调查问卷。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/0bd8819b-7dec-PvE_toggle_blog-1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/0bd8819b-7dec-PvE_toggle_blog.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>What next?</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>接下来会怎样？</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>As mentioned, we need a bit of time to understand what the data is telling us, and what our community is saying. On a surface reading, we know that the test has been polarizing. As always, our decision on how to proceed will prioritize the overall health and enjoyability of the game. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>如前所述，我们需要一些时间来理解数据所传达的信息，以及社区的声音。从表面上看，我们知道这次测试呈现出两极分化的反响。一如既往，我们关于后续方向的决策将以游戏的整体生命值与可玩性为先。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>We don’t yet know what the outcome of the data analysis will be, but we expect to be able to follow up with further information in November.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>我们尚不清楚数据分析的结果会是什么，但预计能在 11 月带来进一步的信息。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Thanks once again for participating in the test and leaving your feedback. It is essential for us to be able to make informed decisions for the development of the game. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>再次感谢你参与测试并留下反馈。这对我们为游戏开发做出明智决策至关重要。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Speak soon, Raiders.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>很快再见，奇袭者们。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The ARC Raiders Team</p>",
    "zh": "<p>ARC Raiders 团队</p>"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "store-update-2-2-0",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/store-update-2-2-0",
  "date": "2026-10-20",
  "tags": [
   "Patch Notes"
  ],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/5b8f3660-1784-live-update-2.2-card-600x200-20-2--300x100.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "Store Update 2.2.0",
   "zh": "商店更新 2.2.0"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/9869e05e-18cf-ARC-Raiders_Steam_EventHeader_StoreUpdate_1920x622-20-12--1024x332.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/9869e05e-18cf-ARC-Raiders_Steam_EventHeader_StoreUpdate_1920x622%20(12).jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"332\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Raiders!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>奇袭者们！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Update 2.2 is rolling out right now with the Wreck Set and a number of fixes. Make sure to restart your game to download.<br><br>The PvE Beta test has wrapped up, and we hope you got the chance to jump in and try it out!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>2.2更新现已推出，包含“残骸套装”和多项修复。请务必重启游戏以完成下载。<br><br>PvE Beta测试已结束，我们希望你有机会参与并试玩！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Now we’d love to hear what you thought. How did PvE compare to your usual experience? What could we improve? And how did the typical PvPvE experience change during the test? Share your thoughts in <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1107589599045361695/1559498786290663585\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">the dedicated PvE feedback channel on Discord</a>.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>现在我们很想听听你的想法。PvE与你的常规体验相比如何？我们可以在哪些方面改进？测试期间，常规的PvPvE体验发生了怎样的变化？请在<a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1107589599045361695/1559498786290663585\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Discord上的PvE专属反馈频道</a>分享你的意见。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>We’ll also be sending a survey to a representative sample of ARC Raiders players starting October 22nd, so keep an eye on your inbox.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>我们还将于10月22日起向ARC Raiders玩家中的代表性样本发送调查问卷，请留意你的收件箱。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<a href=\"https://arcraiders.com/news/pve-test-thanks-for-playing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PvE Matchmaking Toggle Test: Thanks for taking part!October 20, 2026<img src=\"content/news-img/4382ddb0-bfc3-pve-toggle-card-600x200-300x100.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/article-cards/4382ddb0-bfc3-pve-toggle-card-600x200-300x100.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"240\" height=\"80\"></a>",
    "zh": "<a href=\"https://arcraiders.com/news/pve-test-thanks-for-playing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PvE匹配开关测试：感谢参与！2026年10月20日<img src=\"content/news-img/4382ddb0-bfc3-pve-toggle-card-600x200-300x100.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/article-cards/4382ddb0-bfc3-pve-toggle-card-600x200-300x100.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"240\" height=\"80\"></a>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Content and Bug Fixes</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>内容与Bug修复</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Animation</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>动画</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>General</p>",
    "zh": "<p>综合</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where the wind animations would not play on the Frigate.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the Vault Spring jump animation sometimes failed to play.</li><li>Fixed an issue where Selfie Emotes could appear distorted while moving.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了护卫者上风力动画不播放的问题。</li><li>修复了跳跃弹簧的跳跃动画有时无法播放的问题。</li><li>修复了移动时自拍表情可能显示失真的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Grappling Hook</p>",
    "zh": "<p>钩爪</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where swapping to a weapon immediately after throwing the Grappling Hook could cause weapon animations to break.</li><li>Polished climbing rope swing animations for smoother transitions when climbing up and jumping off.</li><li>The Grappling Hook throw animations now follow your up/down aim correctly, and the dodge roll animation while attached has been smoothed to prevent visual popping.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了投掷钩爪后立即切换武器可能导致武器动画异常的问题。</li><li>优化了攀绳摆荡动画，使攀爬和跳下时的过渡更加流畅。</li><li>钩爪投掷动画现在会正确跟随你的上下瞄准方向，附着后的翻滚闪避动画也已平滑处理，防止视觉跳变。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Audio</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>音频</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>General</p>",
    "zh": "<p>综合</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed audio when opening and searching loot containers on the Frigate and inside the Emperor.</li><li>Tuned distance and air absorption for Frigate engine and Frigate Cannon audio to improve balance over range.</li><li>Adjusted blunt damage and debris impact sounds to be louder and scale properly.</li><li>Fixed missing looting sounds on Transmitter Debris objects.</li><li>Adjusted Bombardier mortar firing audio to reduce overly loud, close-sounding effects at long distances.</li><li>Polished Cassio’s and Celeste’s voice lines for improved clarity and consistency.</li><li>Added voice responses for the Cowboy emote.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了在护卫者上和帝王体内打开并搜刮容器时的音频。</li><li>调整了护卫者引擎和护卫者炮台音频的距离与空气吸收，以改善远距离的音量平衡。</li><li>调整了钝击伤害和碎片撞击音效，使其更响亮并合理缩放。</li><li>修复了发射器残骸物体缺少搜刮音效的问题。</li><li>调整了投弹手迫击炮发射音效，减少远距离时过于响亮、过近的听感。</li><li>优化了卡西奥和塞莱斯特的语音台词，提升清晰度和一致性。</li><li>为牛仔表情添加了语音回应。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Ballistic Gondola</p>",
    "zh": "<p>弹道吊舱</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where Ballistic Gondola engine audio could drop out during takeoff, ensuring continuous rocket sound.</li><li>Extended the Ballistic Gondola takeoff preparation sound to prevent it from cutting off when multiple players board in sequence.</li><li>Added distant variations of Ballistic Gondola boarding and takeoff alarms to improve audio positioning and distance cues.</li><li>Polished Ballistic Gondola door interaction sounds and fixed an issue where the door open sound could play twice when entering and exiting.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了弹道吊舱起飞时引擎音频可能中断的问题，确保火箭音效持续播放。</li><li>延长了弹道吊舱起飞准备音效，防止多名玩家依次登舱时音效被截断。</li><li>添加了弹道吊舱登舱和起飞警报的远距离变体，以改善音频定位和距离提示。</li><li>优化了弹道吊舱舱门交互音效，并修复了进出时开门音效可能播放两次的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>ARC</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>ARC</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where certain ARC could be more accurate than intended against sliding players; their aim now correctly accounts for sliding targets.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the Hydra&#x27;s weapons wouldn&#x27;t spread to different targets as often as intended. We&#x27;ve increased the base damage to compensate for this corrected targeting behavior, ensuring its overall threat level remains competitive. We&#x27;ve also addressed an issue where it struggled to hit close-range targets.</li><li>ARC will now react to Gondola Transceivers being interacted with.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了某些ARC对滑行中的玩家命中精度高于预期的问题；其瞄准现在能正确计算滑行目标。</li><li>修复了九头蛇的武器未能按预期频率分散攻击不同目标的问题。我们提高了基础伤害以补偿这一修正后的索敌行为，确保其整体威胁水平保持竞争力。我们还解决了其难以命中近距离目标的问题。</li><li>ARC现在会对有人与吊舱收发器交互做出反应。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Gameplay</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>玩法</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Frigate</p>",
    "zh": "<p>护卫者</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where players could be ejected from the cargo while it was falling from the Frigate.</li><li>Fixed an issue where you could be instantly knocked out when riding on the side of a Frigate cargo drop. Being crushed now only applies at the landing point, and riders inside.</li><li>Fixed an issue where Raiders riding on a Frigate cargo drop could be burned during descent; thruster heat now only affects areas near landing.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了玩家可能在货物从护卫者上掉落时被弹出货物的问题。</li><li>修复了在护卫者空投货物侧面搭乘时可能被瞬间击倒的问题。碾压现在只作用于着陆点以及内部的搭乘者。</li><li>修复了搭乘护卫者空投货物的奇袭者在下降过程中可能被灼烧的问题；推进器热量现在只影响着陆点附近区域。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Emperor</p>",
    "zh": "<p>帝王</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where moving platforms inside the Emperor could become out of sync, improving reliability when riding or crossing them.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了帝王体内移动平台可能失去同步的问题，提升了搭乘或穿越时的可靠性。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Items</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>物品</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>General</p>",
    "zh": "<p>综合</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where Tether Launchers could not be repaired in-round.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the Geometric Fabric Chair Design blueprint was not granted after consuming it.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了系索发射器在局内无法修理的问题。</li><li>修复了消耗“几何布料座椅设计图”蓝图后未获得该物品的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Grappling Hook</p>",
    "zh": "<p>钩爪</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Improved the experience of rappeling to the ground with the Grappling Hook.</li><li>Improved auto-vaulting from Grappling Hook, made the wall detection more reliable and work more consistent on steep slopes.</li><li>Improved swing and rope-climb entry near the ground:</li><li><ul><li>Climbing continues briefly when starting a climb from the ground.</li><li>Velocity toward the rope is preserved, so jumping from the ground carries into a climb.</li><li>Attaching to a rope on a steep slope now enters the wall-climb state.</li><li>Fixed unintended landing when climbing beneath an overhead rope.</li></ul></li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>改善了使用钩爪下降至地面的体验。</li><li>改善了钩爪的自动翻越，墙体检测更可靠，在陡坡上表现更一致。</li><li>改善了接近地面时的摆荡和攀绳进入体验：</li><li><ul><li>从地面开始攀爬时，攀爬动作会短暂延续。</li><li>朝向绳子的速度会保留，因此从地面起跳会顺势进入攀爬。</li><li>在陡坡上附着绳子现在会进入蹬墙爬状态。</li><li>修复了在头顶绳子上方攀爬时意外落地的问题。</li></ul></li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Maps</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>地图</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>General</p>",
    "zh": "<p>综合</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Increased the spawn consistency of ARC Turbines in Buried City, Riven Tides, Blue Gate and Spaceport; in sessions where they previously only had a chance of spawning, they should now instead spawn in an overwhelming majority of, if not all, sessions.</li><li>Fixed visual culling on Frigate lighting scenarios in Buried City, Spaceport, Blue Gate, and Adjusted map boundaries near the Emperor to prevent players from clipping out of bounds.</li><li>Fixed some issues with the coverage of the compaction killboxes inside the Emperor.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>提高了掩埋废城、裂潮镇、蓝门和太空港中ARC涡轮的生成一致性；在之前仅有概率生成的局中，现在绝大多数（如果不是全部）局内都应会生成。</li><li>修复了掩埋废城、太空港、蓝门中护卫者光照场景的视觉剔除问题，并调整了帝王附近的地图边界，防止玩家越界穿出。</li><li>修复了帝王体内压缩必杀区域覆盖范围的一些问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Pendola Pass</p>",
    "zh": "<p>彭多拉山口</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed a collision issue that could cause players to get stuck inside the Fallen Emperor.</li><li>Increased the enemy presence slightly.</li><li>Improved lighting and reflections to enhance visual clarity across multiple weather scenarios.</li><li>Fixed an issue with a Ballistic Gondola navigating through the Secure Communications Mast.</li><li>Fixed floating objects, vegetation and snow clipping through walls.</li><li>Fixed multiple locations where players could get stuck or fall through the terrain.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了可能导致玩家卡在陨落帝王体内的碰撞问题。</li><li>略微增加了敌人数量。</li><li>改善了多种天气场景下的光照和反射，以提高视觉清晰度。</li><li>修复了弹道吊舱穿越安全通讯桅杆时的问题。</li><li>修复了浮空物体、植被和雪穿透墙壁的问题。</li><li>修复了多处玩家可能卡住或穿透地形的位置。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Dam Battlegrounds</p>",
    "zh": "<p>大坝战场</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Removed ARC Turbine spawns from standard sessions and most minor map conditions. In the remaining conditions, they should now spawn in an overwhelming majority of, if not all, sessions.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>从标准局和大多数次要地图条件中移除了ARC涡轮生成。在剩余条件下，它们现在应在绝大多数（如果不是全部）局内生成。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Stella Montis</p>",
    "zh": "<p>星辰山</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Improved lighting and reflections to enhance visual clarity and consistency across time-of-day scenarios.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>改善了不同时间场景下的光照和反射，以提高视觉清晰度和一致性。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Movement</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>移动</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Jumping off the wall during a Wall Run now requires holding backward to activate to help avoid triggering it accidentally.</li><li>Enabled interactions from wall climbing to allow transitioning into ladders and ziplines.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>蹬墙跑中从墙上跳下现在需要按住后退方向才能触发，以避免意外触发。</li><li>启用了蹬墙爬过程中的交互，允许过渡到梯子和滑索。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Performance</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>性能</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Reduced memory usage from loot spawning systems to improve overall stability during rounds.</li><li>Optimized the Frigate entry sequence.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>降低了搜刮生成系统的内存占用，以改善局内整体稳定性。</li><li>优化了护卫者进入序列。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Quest</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>任务</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>“To the Skies” can be completed on any map no matter where progress has been made, players only need to complete the installation in one location to complete the quest.</li><li>“Belly of the Beast” optional objective now requires the correct item as described in the objective text.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>“飞向苍穹”现在可以在任意地图上完成，无论进度在哪里取得，玩家只需在一处完成安装即可完成任务。</li><li>“兽腹深处”的可选目标现在需要与目标文本描述一致的正确物品。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Stability</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>稳定性</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Reduced memory usage in Frigate interiors to address rare crashes when exploring the cargo hold.</li><li>Improved stability in the Frigate by fixing a memory issue that could lead to crashes when moving through its interior.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>降低了护卫者内部的内存占用，以解决探索货舱时偶发的崩溃。</li><li>修复了护卫者内部移动时可能导致崩溃的内存问题，提升了稳定性。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>UI</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>UI</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>General</p>",
    "zh": "<p>综合</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Polished Main Menu lighting and reflections for improved visuals.</li><li>Removed the Expedition Vault tab and related offer.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>优化了主菜单的光照和反射，以提升视觉效果。</li><li>移除了远征翻越标签页及相关商品。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Quest</p>",
    "zh": "<p>任务</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where focus could be lost when navigating the quest tracker with a gamepad.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了使用手柄导航任务追踪器时可能丢失焦点的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Reward Pass</p>",
    "zh": "<p>奖励通行证</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an old Cred icon showing up in character customization for Reward Pass rewards.</li><li>Feats rebalance: We’ve added new Feats, removed some existing ones, and rebalanced others to create a smoother experience and better progression through the Reward Pass.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了角色自定义中奖励通行证奖励显示旧版信用点图标的问题。</li><li>功绩平衡性调整：我们添加了新功绩，移除了一些现有功绩，并重新平衡了其他功绩，以创造更流畅的体验和更好的奖励通行证进度。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Outpost</p>",
    "zh": "<p>哨站</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where the Workshop screen could appear broken if the basic workbench was placed in the last available Outpost slot.</li><li>Your Raider is now hidden when inspecting or decorating furniture and when viewing a bench’s Generator screen, preventing the camera from being blocked.</li><li>The camera rotation, in the Inspect/Decorate view, now requires holding the left mouse button; right mouse drags no longer adjust the camera pitch.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the Inspect/Decorate camera could fade to black when orbiting near walls.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了基础工作台放置在最后一个可用哨站槽位时，工坊界面可能显示异常的问题。</li><li>现在在查看或装饰家具以及查看工作台的发电机界面时，你的奇袭者会被隐藏，防止相机被遮挡。</li><li>查看/装饰视角中的相机旋转现在需要按住鼠标左键；鼠标右键拖动不再调整相机俯仰。</li><li>修复了查看/装饰相机在靠近墙壁旋转时可能淡出至黑屏的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Skill Tree</p>",
    "zh": "<p>技能树</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Node tooltips now show how many levels there are for a skill. Visible as long as the node has not been reached.</li><li>Changed wording from &#x27;Add Skill Point&#x27; to &#x27;Spend Point&#x27; to minimize confusion.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>节点提示现在会显示技能共有多少级。在节点尚未到达前可见。</li><li>将“添加技能点”的措辞改为“花费点数”，以减少混淆。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Weapon Amplification</p>",
    "zh": "<p>武器增强</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Updated the Weapon Bench upgrade tab: the button for amplified weapons now reads &quot;Amplify&quot; instead of &quot;Ascend&quot;.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>更新了武器工作台升级标签页：增强型武器的按钮现在显示“增强”而非“升华”。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>VFX</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>视觉特效</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed a visual issue where the Aphelion’s beam effect could appear cut off.</li><li>Improved explosion impact marks with higher-resolution visuals for clearer craters.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the smoke from firing a weapon could disappear under certain circumstances.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了远日点的光束特效可能出现截断的视觉问题。</li><li>以更高分辨率的视觉效果改善了爆炸冲击痕迹，使弹坑更清晰。</li><li>修复了武器开火产生的烟雾在某些情况下可能消失的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Known Issues</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>已知问题</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>The Raider Tool has the default skin even when other skins are equipped.</li><li>Extracting with partial progress of ‘To The Skies’ quest may result in an inability to complete it.</li><li>‘When Everything Falls’ - some quest objectives, such as “Photograph Port A” may not complete for some players.</li><li>In some instances, if players lose or sell quest items, such as the Equatorial Sundial needed for ‘Clean Hands’, the quest cannot be completed.</li><li>Players can still die after entering the Ballistic Gondola if they are downed and very close to being knocked out.</li><li>Some XBOX players may experience instability or crashes.</li><li>The Grapple Hook can, in rare instances, cause the player using it to be thrown upwards at high speed.</li><li>The Grapple Hook cannot be thrown while inside of the Matriarch’s shield.</li><li>ARC Reclaimers can occasionally fail to dock on the appropriate spot on the Frigate.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>奇袭工具即使装备了其他皮肤，仍显示默认皮肤。</li><li>带着“飞向苍穹”任务的部分进度撤离，可能导致任务无法完成。</li><li>“万物崩塌之时”——部分任务目标（如“拍摄A港口”）对某些玩家可能无法完成。</li><li>在某些情况下，如果玩家丢失或出售了任务物品（如“清理指针”所需的赤道日晷），任务将无法完成。</li><li>玩家在进入弹道吊舱后如果处于倒地且非常接近击倒的状态，仍可能死亡。</li><li>部分XBOX玩家可能会遇到不稳定或崩溃。</li><li>钩爪在极少数情况下可能导致使用者被以高速向上抛飞。</li><li>在族母的护盾内无法投掷钩爪。</li><li>ARC回收者偶尔可能无法停靠在护卫者上的适当位置。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>See you Topside,</p>",
    "zh": "<p>上层见，</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The ARC Raiders Team</p>",
    "zh": "<p>ARC Raiders团队</p>"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "frozen-trail-photo-competition",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/frozen-trail-photo-competition",
  "date": "2026-10-15",
  "tags": [],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/c5a3a199-454b-photo-comp-card_600x200-300x100.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "Say Freeze! Frozen Trail photo competition open now",
   "zh": "说“别动！”霜痕小径摄影大赛现已开启"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Hey Raiders,</p>",
    "zh": "<p>嘿，奇袭者们，</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The camera gadget is finally here, and with it, a new community photo competition… SAY FREEZE!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>相机小道具终于来了，随之而来的还有全新的社区摄影比赛…… 不许动！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>We want Raiders to head Topside and get the best pictures of the new Frozen Trail update. Capture the horror of the Frigate, the belly of the Emperor, or the snowstorms of Pendola Pass! Selfies are welcome, encouraged even. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>我们希望奇袭者们前往上层，拍下霜痕小径更新的最佳照片。捕捉护卫者的恐怖、帝王的腹部，或是彭多拉山口的暴风雪！自拍也欢迎，甚至鼓励哦。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/a812fc54-2363-Say_Freeze-1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/a812fc54-2363-Say_Freeze.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>How to submit photos</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>如何提交照片</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Join our </strong><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1107589599045361695/1560628472773222480\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Discord</strong></a><strong> to share your photos</strong> with us! Embark developers will select their favourite 10, and each winner will receive a prize of<strong> 1,150 Raider Tokens</strong> that can be spent in store on cosmetics (or even the new Premium Reward Pass). Winners will also receive an <strong>exclusive Backpack Charm</strong>, the Instant Film Camera!</p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>加入我们的 </strong><a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1107589599045361695/1560628472773222480\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Discord</strong></a><strong> 分享你的照片</strong>！Embark 开发者将选出他们最喜欢的 10 张，每位获胜者将获得<strong> 1,150 奇袭者代币</strong>，可在商店中用于购买外观（甚至新的高级奖励通行证）。获胜者还将获得一个<strong>专属背包挂饰</strong>——即时胶片相机！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Submissions are open from <strong>October 16-26</strong>, we can’t wait to see the Frozen Trail update through your eyes! </p>",
    "zh": "<p>投稿开放时间为 <strong>10 月 16 日至 26 日</strong>，我们迫不及待想透过你们的眼睛看到霜痕小径更新！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Read the full Terms and Conditions<a href=\"https://id.embark.games/arc-raiders/support/faq/284-say-freeze---frozen-trail-community-competition---official-rules/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> here</a>.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>完整条款与细则请<a href=\"https://id.embark.games/arc-raiders/support/faq/284-say-freeze---frozen-trail-community-competition---official-rules/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">点击此处</a>阅读。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Get snapping, see you Topside!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>快拿起相机，上层见！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The ARC Raiders Team</p>",
    "zh": "<p>ARC Raiders 团队</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><br></p>",
    "zh": "<p><br></p>"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "store-update-2-1-0",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/store-update-2-1-0",
  "date": "2026-10-13",
  "tags": [
   "Patch Notes"
  ],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/d64b9f39-8015-live-update-2.1-card-600x200-600x200.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "Store Update 2.1.0",
   "zh": "商店更新 2.1.0"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/8f52564c-653f-ARC-Raiders_Steam_EventHeader_StoreUpdate_1920x622-20-6--1024x332.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/8f52564c-653f-ARC-Raiders_Steam_EventHeader_StoreUpdate_1920x622%20(6).jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"332\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Raiders!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>奇袭者们！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Update 2.1 is going live right now and marks the start of the PvE toggle Beta Test! We know that the announcement of this highly requested feature has sparked both excitement and skepticism so jump in, try it out, and let us know what you think. Your feedback, along with the in-game data, will help us decide if the toggle becomes a permanent part of the game.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>2.1更新现已上线，标志着PvE开关Beta测试的开始！我们知道这一备受期待的功能的公布既引发了兴奋，也引发了怀疑，所以请加入游戏，亲自尝试，并告诉我们你的想法。你的反馈以及游戏内数据将帮助我们决定该开关是否会成为游戏的永久组成部分。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<a href=\"https://arcraiders.com/news/pve-toggle-what-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PvE Toggle Beta Test: October 13-20October 12, 2026<img src=\"content/news-img/9e62ac2d-deb4-pve-test-card-600x200-300x100.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/article-cards/9e62ac2d-deb4-pve-test-card-600x200-300x100.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"240\" height=\"80\"></a>",
    "zh": "<a href=\"https://arcraiders.com/news/pve-toggle-what-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PvE开关Beta测试：10月13日至20日2026年10月12日<img src=\"content/news-img/9e62ac2d-deb4-pve-test-card-600x200-300x100.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/article-cards/9e62ac2d-deb4-pve-test-card-600x200-300x100.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"240\" height=\"80\"></a>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The Carrion Set is available at the store together with a number of fixes:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>Carrion套装现已在商店上架，同时还有一系列修复：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3>ANIMATION</h3>",
    "zh": "<h3>动画</h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where character models would sometimes appear enlarged.</li><li>Fixed an issue where vaulting onto destroyed ARC parts could launch you or debris into the air; vaults on Matriarch, Vaporizer, Hydra, and Firefly remains are now stable.</li><li>Character animations will now have a short cooldown before they swap sides on repeated shoulder swapping.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了角色模型有时会显得放大的问题。</li><li>修复了翻越被摧毁的ARC部件时可能将你或碎片弹到空中的问题；在族母、汽化者、九头蛇和萤火虫残骸上的翻越现已稳定。</li><li>角色动画现在在反复切换肩部视角时会有一个短暂的冷却时间。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3>AUDIO</h3>",
    "zh": "<h3>音频</h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Reduced overly loud footstep sounds when outdoors and balanced footstep volume across different surfaces.</li><li>Added clearer visual and audio feedback when melee hits land on weak points, making successful strikes easier to recognize.</li><li>Fixed an issue where shoulder swapping repeatedly could make footsteps audio not play.</li><li>Added sound effects to the Cowboy emote.</li><li>Made several more subtle audio improvements and additions.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>降低了室外过响的脚步声，并平衡了不同地面上的脚步音量。</li><li>为近战命中弱点增加了更清晰的视觉和音频反馈，使成功打击更容易辨认。</li><li>修复了反复切换肩部视角可能导致脚步声不播放的问题。</li><li>为牛仔表情添加了音效。</li><li>进行了多项更细微的音频改进和补充。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3>ARC</h3>",
    "zh": "<h3>ARC</h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Frigate hatches now inflict burning damage over time when they open.</li><li>Smoothed collision on Frigate cargo to prevent getting stuck on curved surfaces.</li><li>The Frigate cargo drop has been adjusted to prevent unintended knockouts.</li><li>Fixed unintended interactions between throwables and certain doors on the Emperor.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>护卫者舱门现在在打开时会造成持续的燃烧伤害。</li><li>平滑了护卫者货物的碰撞，防止在曲面上卡住。</li><li>调整了护卫者货物投放，以防止意外的击倒。</li><li>修复了投掷物与帝王上某些门之间的意外交互。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3>COSMETIC</h3>",
    "zh": "<h3>外观</h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>The missing Zenith Outfit toggles will be granted to all players that have completed their fifth Expedition.</li><li>Equipped weapon stencils now display their rarity in the weapon tooltip.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>缺失的Zenith套装切换选项将授予所有已完成第五次远征的玩家。</li><li>已装备的武器贴花现在会在武器提示中显示其稀有度。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3>GAMEPLAY</h3>",
    "zh": "<h3>玩法</h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where the Broad Shoulders skill did not activate on spawn, preventing sprinting despite being within the increased carry limit; inventory weight now updates correctly after loading in.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the Field Repair skill could fail to work after unlocking it if you had already played a round in the same session. Restarting is no longer required for it to take effect.</li><li>Fixed an issue where the camera would shake violently when another player or vegetation came between the player and the camera while firing.</li><li>Fixed an issue where weight values would initially be calculated incorrectly after loading into a round.</li><li>Fixed an issue where Fight or Flight would incorrectly bypass the penalty from Sprinting on Fumes.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了阔肩载物技能在生成时未激活，导致尽管在增加的负重限制内仍无法冲刺的问题；物品栏重量现在在加载后正确更新。</li><li>修复了在同一会话中已玩过一局后解锁野外维修技能时，该技能可能无法生效的问题。不再需要重启才能使其生效。</li><li>修复了开火时另一名玩家或植被进入玩家与相机之间会导致相机剧烈抖动的问题。</li><li>修复了加载进入一局后重量值最初计算错误的问题。</li><li>修复了要么战，要么跑会错误地绕过疲态冲刺惩罚的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3>ITEMS</h3>",
    "zh": "<h3>物品</h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>General</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>通用</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Mobile-Fire Grip Fittings now correctly require Skulker Targeters to research, instead of Skulker Drivers.</li><li>Stamina-restoring consumables can no longer be used while the Sprinting on Fumes cooldown is active.</li><li><ul><li>One of the important balancing considerations for Sprinting on Fumes was the penalty that is applied once the ability has ceased. Having items that could bypass that penalty entirely disrupts the intended risk of using the skill.</li></ul></li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>移动射击握把配件现在正确要求研究“潜伏者”瞄准组件，而不是“潜伏者”引擎。</li><li>恢复耐力的消耗品在疲态冲刺冷却期间无法再使用。</li><li><ul><li>疲态冲刺的重要平衡考量之一是该能力结束后施加的惩罚。拥有能完全绕过该惩罚的物品会破坏使用该技能所预期的风险。</li></ul></li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Grappling Hook</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>钩爪</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Made it easier to vault onto ledges and roofs when using the Grappling Hook, especially on Pendola Pass. Auto-vault now triggers more reliably at the top of rope climbs, and ending a swing on walkable ground is more consistent.</li><li>Fixed several issues that occurred when the Grappling Hook let players swing from objects too light to hold their weight. </li><li>Fixed an issue where the Grappling Hook could detach when tethered to fast‑moving objects like the Ballistic Gondola, causing the line to break during lift‑off.</li><li>The Grappling Hook rope now wraps around geometry while the hook is in flight.</li><li>Fixed an issue where Grappling Hooks and Tether Launchers would not release when the player was downed by fall damage.</li><li>Fixed an issue where Grappling Hooks and Tether Launchers with 0 durability would be destroyed instead of broken.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>使用钩爪时更容易翻越到窗台和屋顶上，尤其是在彭多拉山口。在绳索攀爬顶端自动翻越现在触发得更可靠，在可行走地面上结束摆荡也更加一致。</li><li>修复了钩爪让玩家从太轻而无法承受其重量的物体上摆荡时出现的若干问题。</li><li>修复了钩爪系在快速移动物体（如弹道吊舱）上时可能脱离，导致绳索在升空时断裂的问题。</li><li>钩爪绳索现在在钩子飞行时会缠绕几何体。</li><li>修复了玩家因坠落伤害倒地时钩爪和系索发射器不会释放的问题。</li><li>修复了耐用性为0的钩爪和系索发射器会被摧毁而不是损坏的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3>MAPS</h3>",
    "zh": "<h3>地图</h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>General</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>通用</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Adjusted spawns during Frigate rounds to avoid starting too far from the action under certain circumstances.</li><li>Improved vaulting and traversal on rocky terrain to reduce unintended sliding after climbing.</li><li>Fixed world props in a tunnel sometimes disappearing when viewed from above.</li><li>Improved lighting and reflections in Frigate areas and on Dam Battlegrounds to reduce visual artifacts and improve performance.</li><li>Improved shelter door interactions to prevent players from being squeezed when opening them, with more space provided next to the door.</li><li>Fixed several collision and clipping issues, gaps, and stuck spots across several maps.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>调整了护卫者回合中的出生点，避免在某些情况下初始位置离战斗太远。</li><li>改善了岩石地形上的翻越和通行，以减少攀爬后意外的滑落。</li><li>修复了隧道中的世界道具从上方观看时有时会消失的问题。</li><li>改善了护卫者区域和大坝战场的照明与反射，以减少视觉伪影并提升性能。</li><li>改善了避难所门的交互，防止玩家在开门时被挤压，并在门旁提供了更多空间。</li><li>修复了多张地图上的若干碰撞和穿模问题、缝隙以及卡住点。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Pendola Pass</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>彭多拉山口</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where players could be eliminated despite being inside the Gondola and extracting.<br>Polished terrain and collision on Pendola Pass—fixed gaps, clipping, and hard-to-traverse spots, reduced visual pop-in, and blocked unintended areas.</li><li>Fixed a traversal spot in the Railyard on Pendola Pass where you couldn’t jump up or auto step up as expected.</li><li>Polished Pendola Pass with collision and visual fixes, corrected footstep and impact sounds on station canopies, and improved VFX culling to prevent effects showing through surfaces.</li><li>Adjusted interior snow and terrain blending to prevent landscape from clipping into buildings.</li><li>Adjusted night lighting to be darker with reduced visibility.</li><li>Adjusted ARC Frigate cargo drop points in Pendola Pass to improve accessibility and prevent clipping.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了玩家尽管在吊舱内并正在撤离却仍可能被淘汰的问题。<br>打磨了彭多拉山口的地形和碰撞——修复了缝隙、穿模和难以通行的地点，减少了视觉弹现，并封锁了非预期区域。</li><li>修复了彭多拉山口铁路站场中一处无法按预期跳上或自动踏上台阶的通行点。</li><li>用碰撞和视觉修复打磨了彭多拉山口，修正了车站顶棚上的脚步和撞击音效，并改进了VFX剔除以防止特效穿过表面显示。</li><li>调整了室内积雪和地形混合，防止景观穿入建筑。</li><li>调整了夜间光照，使其更暗并降低能见度。</li><li>调整了彭多拉山口中ARC护卫者的货物投放点，以改善可及性并防止穿模。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3>QUESTS</h3>",
    "zh": "<h3>任务</h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed quest objective progress bars displaying incorrectly whilst in Speranza.</li><li>Fixed an issue where visiting loot‑icon areas in Pendola Pass did not count toward the “Picking Up the Pieces” quest objective.</li><li>Cinematics for “Sizing Things Up” correctly play after quest completion.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了在斯佩兰扎时任务目标进度条显示错误的问题。</li><li>修复了访问彭多拉山口的搜刮图标区域未计入“积少成多”任务目标的问题。</li><li>“审时度势”的过场动画现在会在任务完成后正确播放。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3>PERFORMANCE</h3>",
    "zh": "<h3>性能</h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Reduced memory usage to improve stability on Spaceport, Buried City, and Dam Battlegrounds, with particular benefits on Xbox Series S.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>减少了内存使用，以提升太空港、掩埋废城和大坝战场的稳定性，在Xbox Series S上尤其有益。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3>UI</h3>",
    "zh": "<h3>UI</h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>General</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>通用</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Extended compass and map visibility distance for Gondola markers from 120 to 175 meters.</li><li>Improved placement of pings on the Skulker and Bully when marked from long range.</li><li>In the Weapon Amplification tree, hovering or focusing an upgrade now highlights the path to that node, unless it’s blocked.</li><li>Fixed a bug where spectating could fail to show your squadmates’ HUD info, making it appear they had no Shield.</li><li>Added a new indicator and seen-state tracking for weapon stencils in the customization screen, making newly acquired stencils easier to spot and manage.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>将吊舱标记的罗盘和地图可见距离从120米扩展到175米。</li><li>改进了远距离标记“潜伏者”和恶霸时标记的放置位置。</li><li>在武器增强树中，悬停或聚焦某个升级现在会高亮通往该节点的路径，除非该路径被阻挡。</li><li>修复了观战时可能无法显示队友HUD信息，使其看起来没有护盾的bug。</li><li>在自定义界面中为武器贴花添加了新的指示器和已见状态追踪，使新获得的贴花更容易发现和管理。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Reward Pass</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>奖励通行证</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where the Reward Pass would not progress correctly. The End-Of-Round Reward Pass screen no longer mistakenly counts milestones from previous rounds.</li><li>Polished the Reward Pass completion screen: updated button labels, fixed an incorrect premium icon on non-upgrade buttons, and adjusted layout to prevent image cropping and text overflow.</li><li>Fixed the Reward Pass tile overstating completed levels and aligned the completion icon and “Completed” label.</li><li>The Reward Pass details screen now shows the name of the active pass.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了奖励通行证无法正确推进的问题。回合结束奖励通行证界面不再错误计算此前回合的里程碑。</li><li>打磨了奖励通行证完成界面：更新了按钮标签，修复了非升级按钮上错误的高级图标，并调整了布局以防止图片裁剪和文本溢出。</li><li>修复了奖励通行证磁贴夸大已完成等级的问题，并对齐了完成图标和“已完成”标签。</li><li>奖励通行证详情界面现在显示当前通行证的名称。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Outpost</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>哨站</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where Outpost module recipes would remain in the tracker after installing. </li><li>Added an orange indicator to the Outpost tab when a project step is completed, making new updates easier to spot.</li><li>Fixed an issue where leaving Customization in the Outpost could leave the view out of focus.</li><li>Fixed an issue where exiting decorating in a module room returned you to the base room instead of the room you were editing.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了哨站模块配方在安装后仍留在追踪器中的问题。</li><li>当项目步骤完成时，在哨站标签页添加了橙色指示器，使新更新更容易被发现。</li><li>修复了在哨站中离开自定义界面可能导致视图失焦的问题。</li><li>修复了在模块房间中退出装饰模式时返回基础房间而非正在编辑的房间的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Skill Tree</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>技能树</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed an issue where the Field Salvaging skill could fail to display the right items if unlocked after playing a round in the same session.</li><li>Fixed an issue where camera movement could be prevented if Field Salvaging or Field Repair were interrupted.</li><li>Fixed a bug where End of Round inventory weight and max loadout weight did not reflect character skills like Reduced Weapon Encumbrance or Max Carry Weight.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了在同一会话中玩过一局后解锁的野外打捞技能可能无法显示正确物品的问题。</li><li>修复了如果野外打捞或野外维修被中断，相机移动可能被阻止的问题。</li><li>修复了回合结束时的物品栏重量和最大配装重量未反映角色技能（如武器负重降低或最大负重）的bug。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h3>WEAPONS</h3>",
    "zh": "<h3>武器</h3>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Fixed issue where the Semi-Auto Amplification for the Hairpin did not deal reduced headshot damage.</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>修复了发夹的半自动增强未造成降低后的爆头伤害的问题。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>See you Topside,<br>The ARC Raiders Team</p>",
    "zh": "<p>上层见，<br>ARC Raiders团队</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><br></p>",
    "zh": "<p><br></p>"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "pve-toggle-what-to-know",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/pve-toggle-what-to-know",
  "date": "2026-10-12",
  "tags": [],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/9e62ac2d-deb4-pve-test-card-600x200-600x200.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "PvE Toggle Beta Test: October 13-20",
   "zh": "PvE 切换 Beta 测试：10 月 13 日至 20 日"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/09b36e68-f8ad-ARC-Raiders_Steam_EventHeader-PvEToggleBetaTest_1920x622-1024x332.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/09b36e68-f8ad-ARC-Raiders_Steam_EventHeader-PvEToggleBetaTest_1920x622.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"332\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Raiders, </p>",
    "zh": "<p>奇袭者们，</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>From October 13 (11:00 CEST) - 20 (11:00 CEST), we will be testing a PvE matchmaking toggle in ARC Raiders. Back in September, we gave some general info about <a href=\"https://arcraiders.com/news/pve-toggle-beta-test\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">why we are testing this now</a>, and we recommend reading that if you haven&#x27;t done so already.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>从10月13日（欧洲中部时间11:00）至20日（欧洲中部时间11:00），我们将在ARC Raiders中测试PvE匹配切换功能。早在9月份，我们就提供了一些关于<a href=\"https://arcraiders.com/news/pve-toggle-beta-test\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">为什么我们现在要测试这个</a>的总体信息，如果你还没有读过，我们建议你先阅读一下。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Before the toggle goes live, we want to remind you what the test will mean for you as a player:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>在切换功能上线之前，我们想提醒你这次测试对你作为玩家意味着什么：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>What to know</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>需要了解的内容</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The PvE matchmaking toggle will allow players to switch between the standard PvPvE experience and the new PvE servers. In PvE servers, there will be a few changes to the experience:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>PvE匹配切换将允许玩家在标准PvPvE体验和新的PvE服务器之间切换。在PvE服务器中，体验会有一些变化：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Zero player-to-player damage.</li><li>Throwable items including stun and fire items will not work on other players. </li><li>All other physical interaction items like barricades and ziplines will be unaffected. </li><li>Overall loot value in PvE servers will be lowered.</li><li>Squad separation will not be prioritized, so different size groups will meet more often. </li><li>Certain major map conditions will not offer PvE as an option including Night Raid, Locked Gate, Hidden Bunker, Frigate, and Redirection. </li><li>ARC enemies may re-acquire downed players. There is an eight second grace period after being downed in which players will not be acquired by ARC, but they may attack if they catch you moving after that period. </li><li>Matchmaking times may be affected in low-population regions and during quiet hours, but we will be monitoring this closely to ensure everyone is served good sessions. </li><li>Our standard matchmaking will continue to apply during PvPvE sessions. This will help us gather strong data about how a PvE toggle affects PvPvE sessions before we make any sweeping changes to matchmaking. </li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>玩家之间零伤害。</li><li>包括眩晕和火焰物品在内的可投掷物品对其他玩家无效。</li><li>所有其他物理交互物品，如路障和滑索，将不受影响。</li><li>PvE服务器中的总体搜刮价值将会降低。</li><li>小队分离将不会被优先考虑，因此不同规模的队伍会更频繁地相遇。</li><li>某些主要地图条件将不提供PvE选项，包括夜间奇袭、上锁的大门、隐藏地堡、护卫者和航向重定向。</li><li>ARC敌人可能会重新锁定倒地的玩家。倒地后有8秒的宽限期，在此期间玩家不会被ARC锁定，但如果你在此之后移动，它们可能会攻击你。</li><li>在低人口地区和安静时段，匹配时间可能会受到影响，但我们会密切监控，以确保每个人都能获得良好的对局。</li><li>我们的标准匹配将在PvPvE对局中继续适用。这将帮助我们在对匹配进行任何全面改动之前，收集关于PvE切换如何影响PvPvE对局的可靠数据。</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>What we need from you</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>我们需要你做什么</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>This is a test, and to get the very best data, we need you to play, experience the changes, and leave us as much feedback as possible. If you are a primarily PvE inclined player who wants to see PvE systems implemented in future, we need you to help us understand what is and isn’t working. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>这是一次测试，为了获得最好的数据，我们需要你游玩、体验这些变化，并尽可能多地给我们留下反馈。如果你主要倾向PvE玩法，并希望在未来看到PvE系统的实装，我们需要你帮助我们了解哪些地方有效，哪些地方无效。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>This goes for other players too; if you only see yourself playing the standard PvPvE experience, please continue to play and let us know how (if at all) the toggle is impacting your experience. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>这对其他玩家也同样适用；如果你只打算玩标准PvPvE体验，请继续游玩，并告诉我们这个切换功能是否（以及如何）影响了你的体验。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>After the test has concluded, we will send out a survey where you can offer more detailed feedback about your experience and where you would like to see the PvE option go next. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>测试结束后，我们将发出一份调查问卷，你可以在其中提供关于你的体验以及你希望PvE选项下一步走向的更多详细反馈。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>We’re looking forward to seeing you there!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>我们期待在那里见到你！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The ARC Raiders Team</p>",
    "zh": "<p>ARC Raiders团队</p>"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "trials-season-6",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/trials-season-6",
  "date": "2026-10-12",
  "tags": [],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/70f6046b-f249-trials-s6-card-600x200-600x200.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "Trials Season 6: Frozen Trials",
   "zh": "试炼 第 6 赛季：冰封试炼"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Treacherous conditions call for drastic measures</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>险恶环境需要断然措施</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>With the launch of Frozen Trail, Trials Season 6 has begun!<br>As Raiders push into Pendola Pass, uncovering new threats and mysterious ARC technology, Speranza has never needed more support. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>随着霜痕小径上线，试炼第6赛季已经开启！<br>奇袭者深入彭多拉山口，发现新的威胁与神秘的ARC科技，斯佩兰扎从未如此需要支援。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>ARC machines need to be studied as they swarm the surface, supplies must be collected to uphold day-to-day operations, and weaponry needs fine-tuning - sounds like a job for a go-getting Raider to take on!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>ARC机械涌入地表时需要研究，必须收集补给以维持日常运作，武器也需要精调——听起来正适合积极进取的奇袭者出手！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/0f0364ca-a160-ArcRaiders_ScreenShot_16x9_TrialsS06_02_4K-1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/0f0364ca-a160-ArcRaiders_ScreenShot_16x9_TrialsS06_02_4K.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Trials Season 6</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>试炼第6赛季</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>Start date: October 8, 2026</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>开始日期：2026年10月8日</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><strong>End date: January 12, 2027</strong></p>",
    "zh": "<p><strong>结束日期：2027年1月12日</strong></p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The Maestro Outfit is your Season 6 grand prize, dazzling Speranzans with gilded trim while stating your claim as a veteran Raider who can rally people to a good cause. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>大师套装是第6赛季的大奖，以镀金镶边惊艳斯佩兰扎人，同时昭示你作为资深奇袭者的地位——能号召众人投身善举。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Complete your weekly objectives earning Blueprints and gear along the way as you climb towards Cantina Legend!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>完成每周目标，沿途赢取蓝图与装备，向酒馆传奇攀升！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Lead the leaderboard parade to earn the Maestro Outfit and its toggles, reaching the lofty ranks of Hotshot and Cantina Legend to unlock the Yellow and Red colors, and earn additional cosmetics for your final season placement:</p>",
    "zh": "<p>在排行榜前列领跑，赢取大师套装及其切换配色，达到高手与酒馆传奇的高阶位即可解锁黄色与红色配色，并根据赛季最终排名获得额外装饰品：</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<ul><li>Backpack Charm: Sheriff Badge</li><li>Backpack attachment: Infrared Transmitter</li><li>Emote: Pumped Dance</li><li>Scrappy Outfit: Pop Helmet</li></ul>",
    "zh": "<ul><li>背包挂饰：警长徽章</li><li>背包配件：红外发射器</li><li>表情：劲舞</li><li>废品仔套装：爆爆头盔</li></ul>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>New Trials challenges</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>新试炼挑战</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>New ARC threats mean new challenges. Speranza security needs all Raiders to take on the Skulker and Bully, learning their combat tactics and experimenting with their unique new technology. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>新的ARC威胁意味着新的挑战。斯佩兰扎安保区需要所有奇袭者迎战潜伏者与恶霸，学习它们的战术，试验它们独特的新科技。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Trials Season 6 will task you with a variety of new challenges, from dealing damage with Skulker Targeter and Bully Fragmenter, scavenging in new Pendola Pass hotspots, to using the ARC as target practice with your new arsenal. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>试炼第6赛季将为你带来各种新挑战，从使用“潜伏者”瞄准组件与“恶霸”破片弹造成伤害，到在彭多拉山口新热点区域拾荒，再到用新武器库以ARC作为靶子练习，不一而足。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Dominate the freezing peaks of Pendola Pass, and prove you’ve got what it takes to become a Cantina Legend. Best of luck in Trials Season 6!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>征服彭多拉山口的冰封峰峦，证明你有实力跻身酒馆传奇。祝你在试炼第6赛季好运！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The ARC Raiders Team</p>",
    "zh": "<p>ARC Raiders团队</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p><br></p>",
    "zh": "<p><br></p>"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": "collector-set-dlc",
  "url": "https://arcraiders.com/news/collector-set-dlc",
  "date": "2026-10-08",
  "tags": [],
  "thumb": "content/news-img/66a8f674-c3d7-collector-set-card-600x200-600x200.webp",
  "title": {
   "en": "Collector Set DLC: Gear up for Frozen Trail",
   "zh": "收藏套装DLC：为霜痕小径整装待发"
  },
  "body": [
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Raiders,</p>",
    "zh": "<p>奇袭者们，</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Frozen Trail is here - log in now to experience all of the new content: New map, massive ARC Operation, enemies, weapon upgrades, items, Outposts, and much more!</p>",
    "zh": "<p>霜痕小径已经上线——立即登录，体验全部新内容：新地图、大规模 ARC 行动、新敌人、武器升级、新物品、哨站等等！</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "video",
    "id": "084_0Td9mhs",
    "title": "Collector Set DLC - ARC Raiders"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<h2>Collector Set DLC</h2>",
    "zh": "<h2>收藏套装DLC</h2>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>For those Raiders who want to fully gear up for the new frontier, the Collector Set DLC offers access to a new cosmetic set, the Renzo, Dragon’s Breath Weapon Stencil, Bob Hair Style, and 2,400 Raider Tokens. It also comes with an exclusive Retro Sofa for your Raider Outpost and is the only way to get a blueprint for the new Banjo musical instrument. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>想为新边境做好万全准备的奇袭者可以选择收藏套装DLC，其中包含全新外观套装伦佐套装、龙息武器贴花、波波头发型，以及 2,400 枚奇袭者代币。它还附赠一款可摆放在奇袭者哨站的独家复古沙发，并且是获得新乐器班卓琴蓝图的唯一途径。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The Collector Set DLC also grants access to the Frozen Trail Premium Reward Pass! The Premium Reward Pass unlocks all the premium toggles, modifications, and colorways for the new outfits. It also contains exclusive legendary weapon stencils, hairstyles, and a total of up to 1,150 Raider Tokens.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>收藏套装DLC 还包含霜痕小径高级奖励通行证！高级奖励通行证会解锁新服装的全部高级切换、修改和配色，还包含独家传奇武器贴花、发型，以及总计最多 1,150 枚奇袭者代币。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "image",
    "html": "<img src=\"content/news-img/dbb4a224-5818-collector_set-1024x576.webp\" data-full=\"https://assets.arcraiders.com/media/dbb4a224-5818-collector_set.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\">"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Check out the Collector Set DLC, and see the available cosmetics and rewards for yourself, available now on <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/store/productid/9p76gm1x63vk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Xbox</a>, <a href=\"https://store.playstation.com/en-us/product/EP6848-PPSA04998_00-0970183989801781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Playstation</a>, <a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/arc-raiders-arc-raiders-frozen-trail-collector-set-e8cd45\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epic</a>, and <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/5201760/ARC_Raiders__Frozen_Trail_Collector_Set/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Steam</a>. </p>",
    "zh": "<p>收藏套装DLC 现已在 <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/store/productid/9p76gm1x63vk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Xbox</a>、<a href=\"https://store.playstation.com/en-us/product/EP6848-PPSA04998_00-0970183989801781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Playstation</a>、<a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/arc-raiders-arc-raiders-frozen-trail-collector-set-e8cd45\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Epic</a> 和 <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/5201760/ARC_Raiders__Frozen_Trail_Collector_Set/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Steam</a> 上推出，快去亲自看看其中的外观和奖励吧。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>Gear up and get out there, Raider.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>整装出发吧，奇袭者。</p>"
   },
   {
    "type": "html",
    "en": "<p>The ARC Raiders Team</p>",
    "zh": "<p>ARC Raiders团队</p>"
   }
  ]
 }
];
